// films 的英文：中文原文 → 英文，空字符串是还没写的。由 scripts/i18n-en.mjs 生成条目，英文手写（写法见 docs/ENGLISH.md）
export const content: Record<string, string> = {
  "罗伯特·泽米吉斯 / 汤姆·汉克斯": "Robert Zemeckis / Tom Hanks",
  "犹他州 163 号公路约 13 英里路标处，纪念碑谷部落公园以北（公路归犹他州交通厅管，不在部落公园里）": "Near mile marker 13 on U.S. Highway 163, north of Monument Valley Navajo Tribal Park (the highway is managed by the Utah Department of Transportation and isn't part of the tribal park)",
  "阿甘横穿美国跑了三年多，跟着跑的人越来越多，他在这条笔直的公路上忽然停下、转身。画面是公路正中一条长长的直线伸向远处的红色孤峰。": "After more than three years of running back and forth across America, with a growing crowd behind him, Forrest suddenly stops on this ruler-straight highway and turns around. The shot is a long line down the middle of the road, running out to red buttes on the horizon.",
  "从纪念碑谷游客中心往北开约 20 分钟、过了 Mexican Hat 方向的岔路之前，路边有一块写着 Forrest Gump Point 的小牌子和砂石停车处。拍的人站在路肩上，镜头放低、用长焦往南压缩公路和孤峰；被拍的人站在路肩白线外侧。镜头朝南，早晚太阳在东西两侧，都是侧光，日出日落时孤峰最红；中午太阳在南边，是逆光。": "About 20 minutes north of the Monument Valley visitor center, before the turnoff toward Mexican Hat, a small Forrest Gump Point sign marks a gravel pullout. The photographer stands on the shoulder, gets the camera low, and points a telephoto lens south to compress the road and the buttes. Your subject stays on the shoulder, outside the white line. Because you're facing south, early and late light comes from the side, and the buttes are reddest at sunrise and sunset; at midday the sun is in front of you.",
  "这是正常通车的国道，车速 100 公里以上，还有大货车。不要站到路中间拍：犹他州旅游局专门提醒过这里出过伤亡事故。想要“站在路中间”的效果，用长焦从路肩斜着拍。": "This is a working U.S. highway with traffic moving faster than 60 mph, big trucks included. Don't stand in the middle of the road for a photo: the Utah Office of Tourism specifically warns that people have been hurt and killed here. For the “middle of the road” look, shoot at an angle from the shoulder with a telephoto lens.",
  "非要拍路中间的，两个人配合：一人在路肩专门看两头来车，看到车就喊，拍完马上回路肩，不要停留。": "If you insist on a mid-road shot, work in pairs. One person stays on the shoulder watching both directions and calls out the moment a car appears. Get back to the shoulder as soon as you have the shot, and don't linger.",
  "去 Moab、拱门方向顺路经过；附近的 Valley of the Gods 和 Goosenecks 州立公园也可以一起看。": "It's right on the way to Moab and Arches. Valley of the Gods and Goosenecks State Park are close by and easy to add.",
  "约翰·福特 / 约翰·韦恩": "John Ford / John Wayne",
  "谷地自驾环线中段的约翰·福特点，一块伸出去的岩台正对 Merrick Butte": "John Ford's Point, midway around the Valley Drive loop: a rock ledge jutting out toward Merrick Butte",
  "故事设在得州，外景几乎都在纪念碑谷拍。约翰·福特点这一带拍的是骑兵、骑警在孤峰前集结准备出击的段落，人马站在岩台上，背后是空旷的谷地和红色孤峰。": "The story is set in Texas, but nearly all the exteriors were filmed in Monument Valley. Around John Ford's Point, cavalry and Texas Rangers gather in front of the buttes before riding out, men and horses on the ledge with the empty valley and red buttes behind them.",
  "开 Valley Drive 环线（砂土路）到约翰·福特点停车场，走几十米到岩台。拍的人退到岩台后方稍高处，把岩台、人和远处的 Merrick Butte 一起收进来；上午光照在孤峰正面，下午逆光适合拍剪影。纳瓦霍人常在岩台上牵马，骑马拍照现场付费。": "Drive the Valley Drive loop (dirt) to the John Ford's Point parking area and walk a few dozen yards to the ledge. The photographer steps back to slightly higher ground behind the ledge to fit the ledge, your subject, and distant Merrick Butte in one frame. Morning light falls on the face of the butte; afternoon backlight is good for silhouettes. Navajo horsemen often wait on the ledge with horses, and you pay on the spot for a photo on horseback.",
  "岩台三面是陡坎，没有护栏，拍照别往边上退；骑马拍照听马主人安排。": "The ledge drops off steeply on three sides and has no railing, so don't back toward the edge for a shot. If you pose on horseback, follow the owner's instructions.",
  "环线只能在规定的土路上开，冬季下午 2:30、其他季节 3:30 前进环线，以纳瓦霍部落公园公告为准。": "Drive only on the designated dirt road. Enter the loop by 2:30 p.m. in winter and by 3:30 p.m. the rest of the year; check current notices from Navajo Nation Parks & Recreation.",
  "公园门票每人 10 美元，国家公园年卡不能用。": "Admission is $10 per person, and America the Beautiful passes aren't accepted.",
  "《搜索者》在纪念碑谷拍外景是确定的；约翰·福特点拍的具体是哪场戏，几家说法不一样（有的说是骑警准备突袭营地，有的说是印第安营地被袭）。": "The Searchers definitely filmed its exteriors in Monument Valley, but sources disagree on which scene was shot at John Ford's Point: some say it's the Rangers preparing to raid a camp, others say it's the attack on a Native American camp.",
  "纪念碑谷谷地，游客中心下方 Valley Drive 环线一带": "The Monument Valley floor, around the Valley Drive loop below the visitor center",
  "约翰·福特第一次来纪念碑谷拍的片子，也是让约翰·韦恩成名的片子：一辆驿站马车载着一车各怀心事的乘客，穿过空旷的谷地，往远处的红色孤峰驶去。片中纪念碑谷的镜头加起来只有几分钟，其余大多在加州拍。": "The first film John Ford made in Monument Valley, and the one that made John Wayne a star: a stagecoach full of passengers, each with troubles of their own, crosses the empty valley toward red buttes on the horizon. The Monument Valley shots add up to only a few minutes; most of the rest was filmed in California.",
  "从游客中心下坡开进 Valley Drive 环线，在连指手套峰（West / East Mitten）和 Merrick Butte 之间的空旷谷地找路边能停车的宽处。拍的人退到路边高一点的地方，用中长焦把砂土路、谷地和三座孤峰压在一起，等有车或骑马的人从路上经过再按快门。早上太阳从孤峰背后升起，拍出来是剪影；下午顺光，孤峰最红。": "From the visitor center, drive downhill onto the Valley Drive loop and look for a wide spot to pull over in the open valley between the Mittens (West and East Mitten Buttes) and Merrick Butte. The photographer steps up to slightly higher ground beside the road and uses a medium-telephoto lens to stack the dirt road, the valley floor, and the three buttes, then waits for a car or a rider on horseback to come along before taking the shot. In the morning the sun rises behind the buttes and they turn into silhouettes; in the afternoon the light is behind you and the buttes are at their reddest.",
  "环线是砂土路，只能在规定的路上开，坑多，开慢一点；冬季下午 2:30、其他季节 3:30 前进环线，以纳瓦霍部落公园公告为准。": "The loop is a dirt-and-sand road with plenty of potholes. Drive only on the designated road, and take it slow. Enter the loop by 2:30 p.m. in winter and by 3:30 p.m. the rest of the year; check current notices from Navajo Nation Parks & Recreation.",
  "Goulding's 旅馆里有个小博物馆，展出福特剧组当年在这里拍片的老照片。": "Goulding's Lodge has a small museum with old photos of Ford's crews filming here.",
  "在纪念碑谷拍外景是确定的（AFI 记了片方资料）；具体是在谷地哪里拍的哪几个镜头没有公开，上面写的是能拍到同样画面的地方。": "Monument Valley as an exterior location is confirmed (the AFI Catalog records it from studio materials), but exactly which shots were filmed where in the valley has never been made public. The spot described here is one where you can get the same view.",
  "约翰·福特 / 亨利·方达": "John Ford / Henry Fonda",
  "纪念碑谷谷地（剧组在这里搭了一整座墓碑镇布景，早已拆掉，具体位置没有公开）": "The Monument Valley floor (the crew built an entire Tombstone town set here; it was taken down long ago, and its exact location hasn't been made public)",
  "讲怀亚特·厄普兄弟在墓碑镇当警长、和克兰顿一家结怨的故事。真的墓碑镇在亚利桑那南部，福特却把整座小镇搭在纪念碑谷：镇上的街道一眼望过去，尽头就是红色的孤峰。": "The story of Wyatt Earp and his brothers, with Wyatt serving as marshal of Tombstone and feuding with the Clanton family. The real Tombstone is in southern Arizona, but Ford built the whole town in Monument Valley: look down the main street and there are red buttes at the end of it.",
  "布景已经不在了。想拍“小镇街道尽头是孤峰”的感觉，可以在游客中心一带用长焦，把远处的孤峰压到前景的建筑、围栏后面；或者开 Valley Drive，找一段笔直的土路，被拍的人站在路边、背后是孤峰。下午到傍晚孤峰顺光，颜色最暖。": "The set is gone. For the feel of a town street ending at a butte, use a telephoto lens around the visitor center to stack the distant buttes behind buildings or fences in the foreground. Or drive the Valley Drive, find a straight stretch of dirt road, and have your subject stand at the roadside with the buttes behind. From afternoon into evening the light is on the buttes and the color is warmest.",
  "环线上偶尔也有车，拍照时人站在路边，别站在土路中间。": "Cars do come along the loop now and then, so stand at the side of the road for photos, not in the middle of it.",
  "环线开放时间和门票以纳瓦霍部落公园公告为准，国家公园年卡不能用。": "Check Navajo Nation Parks & Recreation notices for loop hours and admission. America the Beautiful passes aren't accepted.",
  "墓碑镇布景搭在纪念碑谷是确定的；搭在谷地哪个位置没查到。": "The Tombstone set was definitely built in Monument Valley; we couldn't find where in the valley it stood.",
  "纪念碑谷谷地（具体机位没有公开）": "The Monument Valley floor (exact camera positions haven't been made public)",
  "福特“骑兵三部曲”的第二部，也是他在纪念碑谷拍的第一部彩色片。最有名的一个镜头：骑兵巡逻队排成一行走过谷地，背后是压过来的雷雨云和闪电。摄影师当时觉得光线不够、不想拍，福特坚持开机，这部片后来拿了奥斯卡最佳彩色摄影。": "The second film in Ford's cavalry trilogy, and the first he shot in color in Monument Valley. Its most famous shot: a cavalry patrol rides single file across the valley as a thunderstorm bears down behind them, lightning and all. The cinematographer thought the light was too poor and didn't want to shoot; Ford insisted on rolling, and the film went on to win the Oscar for Best Cinematography (Color).",
  "这种画面要碰天气：7–9 月午后常有雷雨，云从远处压过来时，在游客中心观景台或 Valley Drive 的空旷处，用中焦把低低的乌云和孤峰一起拍，地平线放低、让天空占大半。远处正好有骑马团经过时，最像片中的巡逻队。": "You need the weather to cooperate for this one. Afternoon thunderstorms are common from July through September. When clouds start rolling in from the distance, go to the visitor center overlook or an open stretch of the Valley Drive and use a medium focal length to frame the low, dark clouds with the buttes. Keep the horizon low and let the sky fill most of the frame. If a horseback group happens to pass in the distance, it looks a lot like the film's patrol.",
  "打雷时别站在空旷的高处或岩台上，回车里或室内等；雷雨后土路积水打滑，环线可能临时关闭。": "When you hear thunder, get off open high ground and rock ledges and wait in your car or indoors. After a storm the dirt road can flood and turn slick, and the loop may close temporarily.",
  "骑马团由纳瓦霍向导带，在游客中心一带报名，费用现场问。": "Horseback tours are led by Navajo guides. Sign up around the visitor center and ask about prices there.",
  "在纪念碑谷拍、雷雨那场是福特坚持拍下来的，几家来源都写了；那场具体在谷地哪里没查到。": "Several sources say the film shot in Monument Valley and that Ford insisted on filming the thunderstorm scene; we couldn't find where in the valley that scene was shot.",
  "斯坦利·库布里克": "Stanley Kubrick",
  "纪念碑谷上空（航拍，具体航线没有公开）": "The skies over Monument Valley (aerial footage; the exact flight path hasn't been made public)",
  "片子后段“木星与无限之外”一段：穿过光的隧道之后，镜头低低地掠过一颗陌生星球的地面，颜色被处理成奇怪的蓝紫、橙红。仔细看，能认出纪念碑谷的孤峰和台地。": "Late in the film, in the “Jupiter and Beyond the Infinite” sequence, after the journey through a tunnel of light, the camera skims low over the surface of an unknown planet, its colors processed into strange blue-violets and orange-reds. Look closely and you can pick out the buttes and mesas of Monument Valley.",
  "公园里不能飞无人机，地面上拍不出航拍。地面上最接近的是日出前后的游客中心观景台：天色发蓝、孤峰是剪影，后期把色调往冷色推，就有点片中“外星”的感觉。想看俯瞰的样子，只能坐观光飞机，有没有航线、价格以运营方为准。": "Drones aren't allowed in the park, and you can't get an aerial view from the ground. The nearest ground-level equivalent is the visitor center overlook around sunrise: the sky turns blue and the buttes are silhouettes. Push the colors cooler in editing for a hint of the film's alien look. For a view from above, your only option is a scenic flight; check with operators about routes and prices.",
  "纳瓦霍部落公园不能私自飞无人机。": "Flying a drone in the Navajo tribal park without permission isn't allowed.",
  "这一段里还有别的地方的航拍，不是每个镜头都是纪念碑谷。": "The sequence also includes aerial footage of other places; not every shot is Monument Valley.",
  "赛尔乔·莱昂内 / 克劳迪娅·卡汀娜": "Sergio Leone / Claudia Cardinale",
  "意大利导演莱昂内的经典西部片，大部分在西班牙拍，只有少数外景跑到纪念碑谷。常被提到的是女主角吉尔坐马车去荒原上的甜水镇那段：马车穿过红色孤峰之间的谷地，配着莫里康内的音乐。": "Italian director Sergio Leone's classic Western was filmed mostly in Spain, with only a few exteriors shot in Monument Valley. The part most often mentioned is Jill's buggy ride out to Sweetwater in the wilderness: the buggy rolls through the valley between red buttes to Ennio Morricone's score.",
  "开 Valley Drive，在路边能同时看到连指手套峰和远处台地的空旷处停车。拍的人退远用长焦，等环线上的车或骑马团从孤峰前经过，画面里留出大片天空；傍晚前后孤峰最红，云多的时候更有气势。": "Drive the Valley Drive and pull over in an open spot where you can see both the Mittens and the distant mesas. Back off with a telephoto lens and wait for a car or a horseback group on the loop to pass in front of the buttes, leaving plenty of sky in the frame. The buttes are reddest around early evening, and a cloudy sky adds drama.",
  "据说莱昂内来勘景时，把福特拍过的机位一个个指给剧组看，可以和《搜索者》《关山飞渡》的机位一起找。": "Leone reportedly pointed out Ford's old camera positions one by one to his crew when he came to scout, so you can look for them along with the camera spots from The Searchers and Stagecoach.",
  "在纪念碑谷拍过外景是确定的；吉尔坐马车那段是常见的说法，没找到可靠来源写明在纪念碑谷拍的是哪几场戏。": "The film definitely shot exteriors in Monument Valley. Jill's buggy ride is the scene usually cited, but we couldn't find a reliable source that says which scenes were filmed there.",
  "丹尼斯·霍珀 / 彼得·方达": "Dennis Hopper / Peter Fonda",
  "从 Kayenta 往北到纪念碑谷的 163 号公路，和游客中心观景台看出去的谷地": "US-163 from Kayenta north to Monument Valley, and the view over the valley from the visitor center overlook",
  "两个骑着改装摩托的年轻人一路向东，路过一座黑色的火山岩尖峰，镜头再慢慢扫过黎明时的纪念碑谷孤峰。没有台词，只有摩托、公路和大片荒原。": "Two young men on customized motorcycles ride east past a black volcanic spire, and then the camera slowly pans across the buttes of Monument Valley at dawn. No dialogue, just motorcycles, the highway, and miles of open desert.",
  "日出前到游客中心旁的观景台（The View 酒店前面），太阳从连指手套峰背后升起，孤峰是剪影，镜头慢慢横着扫，最像片中的长镜头。白天沿 163 号公路往南开，Kayenta 以北路东边那座黑色尖峰就是 Agathla Peak，在路边宽敞的停车处拍公路和尖峰。": "Get to the overlook beside the visitor center (in front of The View Hotel) before sunrise. The sun comes up behind the Mittens and silhouettes the buttes, and a slow horizontal pan comes closest to the film's long take. During the day, drive south on US-163: north of Kayenta, the black spire on the east side of the road is Agathla Peak. Shoot the highway and the peak from a wide, proper roadside pullout.",
  "163 号公路车速快、有大货车，只在正规的路边停车处停，拍公路别站到车道上。": "Traffic on US-163 is fast and includes big trucks. Stop only at proper pullouts, and don't step into the travel lanes to photograph the road.",
  "骑摩托来的话，保留地白天风沙大、晚上路上常有牛羊和野马，天黑前到住处。": "If you're riding a motorcycle, expect strong wind and blowing sand on the reservation during the day, and cattle, sheep, and free-roaming horses on the road at night. Get to your lodging before dark.",
  "犹他州旅游局写了片中扫过纪念碑谷的全景镜头；路过 Agathla Peak 的说法来自影评和取景地整理，没找到片方资料。": "The Utah Office of Tourism mentions the film's panoramic shots across Monument Valley. The Agathla Peak connection comes from film reviews and location roundups; we couldn't find studio materials that confirm it.",
  "罗伯特·泽米吉斯 / 迈克尔·J·福克斯": "Robert Zemeckis / Michael J. Fox",
  "纪念碑谷谷地边上（剧组搭了一座露天汽车电影院布景，拍完就拆了，具体位置没有公开）": "The edge of the Monument Valley floor (the crew built a drive-in theater set here and took it down after filming; its exact location hasn't been made public)",
  "马蒂开着时光车德罗宁，从 1955 年孤峰脚下的一座露天汽车电影院出发，加速冲向画着印第安人的银幕，一下子回到 1885 年。穿越过去以后，眼前就是空旷的谷地和红色孤峰。": "Marty takes off in the DeLorean time machine from a 1955 drive-in theater at the foot of the buttes, speeds toward a screen painted with Native Americans, and lands in 1885. Once he's through, all he sees is an empty valley and red buttes.",
  "布景早就不在了。想拍“汽车 + 孤峰”的同款，在游客中心停车场或 Valley Drive 起点一带，把车停在能看到连指手套峰的地方，拍的人蹲低用广角，让车头冲着孤峰；日落前一小时孤峰最红，天黑以后开着车灯拍也有电影里的味道。": "The set is long gone. For a car-and-buttes version, park in the visitor center lot or near the start of the Valley Drive somewhere with a view of the Mittens. Crouch low with a wide-angle lens and point the front of the car toward the buttes. The buttes are reddest in the hour before sunset; after dark, a shot with the headlights on has a movie feel too.",
  "环线里只能在规定的土路上开，别为了拍照开出路面；天黑前要出环线。": "Inside the loop, drive only on the designated dirt road, and don't leave it for photos. Be out of the loop before dark.",
  "露天电影院布景在纪念碑谷是确定的；搭在谷地哪个位置没查到。": "The drive-in set was definitely in Monument Valley; we couldn't find where in the valley it stood.",
  "戈尔·维宾斯基 / 约翰尼·德普": "Gore Verbinski / Johnny Depp",
  "Valley Drive 环线中段的约翰·福特点": "John Ford's Point, midway around the Valley Drive loop",
  "德普演的印第安人通托和蒙面侠约翰在纪念碑谷骑马、赶路的几场戏；有一个画面是两人站在约翰·福特点伸出去的岩台上，背后是 Merrick Butte。剧组的营地就扎在纪念碑谷，纳瓦霍族领导人还到片场给两位主演送了毛毯。": "Several scenes of Depp's Tonto and the masked man, John, riding and traveling through Monument Valley. In one shot the two stand on the ledge jutting out at John Ford's Point, with Merrick Butte behind them. The production camped in Monument Valley, and Navajo Nation leaders visited the set to present the two leads with blankets.",
  "开到约翰·福特点停车场，走到岩台边。两个人站在岩台上一左一右、面向孤峰，拍的人退到岩台后方高一点的地方，用中焦把人、岩台和 Merrick Butte 收进来；上午孤峰正面受光，傍晚逆光拍剪影，最像海报。": "Drive to the John Ford's Point parking area and walk out to the ledge. Two people stand on the ledge, one on each side, facing the butte, while the photographer moves to slightly higher ground behind the ledge and uses a medium focal length to fit both people, the ledge, and Merrick Butte in the frame. In the morning the light is on the face of the butte; at dusk, shoot silhouettes against the light for the closest match to the poster.",
  "岩台三面是陡坎，没有护栏，拍照别往边上退；骑马拍照听马主人安排，现场付费。": "The ledge drops off steeply on three sides and has no railing, so don't back toward the edge for a shot. If you pose on horseback, follow the owner's instructions and pay on the spot.",
  "片中也在亚利桑那的谢伊峡谷（Canyon de Chelly）拍过，不全是这里。": "The film also shot at Canyon de Chelly in Arizona; not all of it was filmed here.",
  "迈克尔·贝 / 马克·沃尔伯格": "Michael Bay / Mark Wahlberg",
  "纪念碑谷部落公园和旁边的 163 号公路（犹他、亚利桑那交界一带，公路归州交通厅管）": "Monument Valley Navajo Tribal Park and nearby US-163 around the Utah–Arizona line (the highway is managed by the state department of transportation)",
  "这部片就是在纪念碑谷开拍的：新造型的擎天柱和几辆跑车（变形前的汽车人）在红色孤峰之间的公路上排成车队飞驰。": "Production on the film began in Monument Valley: the redesigned Optimus Prime and several sports cars (Autobots in vehicle form) race in convoy along the highway between red buttes.",
  "163 号公路从游客中心路口往北到阿甘点一段，路两侧都是孤峰。拍车队同款，就在路边宽敞的停车处，用长焦对着来车方向，把公路和远处的孤峰压在一起，等车开过来；早上和傍晚侧光，孤峰最立体。": "On US-163 from the visitor center turnoff north to Forrest Gump Point, there are buttes on both sides of the road. For a convoy shot, use a wide roadside pullout and aim a telephoto lens at oncoming traffic to compress the highway and the distant buttes, then wait for cars to come through. Morning and evening side light gives the buttes the most depth.",
  "这是正常通车的国道，车速快、有大货车，人和三脚架都留在路肩外，别到车道上拍。": "This is a working U.S. highway with fast traffic and big trucks. Keep yourself and your tripod beyond the shoulder, off the pavement, and don't step into the lanes to shoot.",
  "往北开到阿甘点就是《阿甘正传》的机位，可以一起拍。": "Continue north to Forrest Gump Point for the Forrest Gump camera position and get both on one trip.",
  "导演开拍时公布了在纪念碑谷部落公园开拍、车队开过 163 号公路；成片里具体是哪几个镜头，只有粉丝整理的资料说是残存的汽车人重新会合那段。": "The director announced at the start of production that filming had begun in Monument Valley Navajo Tribal Park, with the convoy driving US-163. Which shots made the final cut is documented only by fans, who say it's the sequence where the surviving Autobots regroup.",
  "史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格 / 哈里森·福特": "Steven Spielberg / Harrison Ford",
  "窗户区的双拱门": "Double Arch in the Windows Section",
  "开场的 1912 年：少年印第安纳·琼斯跟童子军在犹他沙漠骑马，溜进一个山洞撞见盗墓贼。画面里两道相连的巨大拱门立在岩壁上方；山洞是剧组搭的，现实里拱下没有洞。": "The 1912 opening: young Indiana Jones is out riding in the Utah desert with his Boy Scout troop when he slips into a cave and stumbles on a gang of looters. Two huge, joined arches rise above the rock wall. The cave was a set; there's no cave under the real arches.",
  "开到窗户区下层的 Double Arch 停车场，走约 0.5 公里平缓沙路到拱脚。想要电影里那种“远处看拱门”的画面，就在停车场到拱门的半路上回头找角度，人放小、让两道拱占画面上半部；想拍仰视，就走到两道拱正下方用广角往上拍。早上拱门内侧背阴、颜色柔和，日落前一小时外侧最红。": "Drive to the Double Arch parking area in the lower Windows Section and walk about 0.3 mile on a gentle, sandy path to the base of the arches. For the film's view of the arches from a distance, turn around about halfway between the lot and the arch and look for your angle: keep people small and let the two arches fill the top half of the frame. For a looking-up shot, stand directly beneath both arches and shoot up with a wide-angle lens. In the morning the inner side is in shade with soft color; the outer side is reddest in the hour before sunset.",
  "可以爬到拱下的岩石上，但往下爬比往上难，看好路线；别爬到拱上去，拱门园区禁止攀爬拱门。": "You can scramble onto the rocks under the arches, but getting down is harder than going up, so plan your route first. Don't climb onto the arches themselves; climbing on arches is prohibited in Arches National Park.",
  "2026 年进园不用预约时段，但 3–10 月白天入口常排队一小时以上，早上 7 点前进园最顺。": "No timed-entry reservation is needed in 2026, but from March through October the daytime entrance line often runs an hour or more. Entering before 7 a.m. is easiest.",
  "对面就是南北窗和炮塔拱门，一次停车都能看。": "North Window, South Window, and Turret Arch are right across the way, so one parking stop covers them all.",
  "雷德利·斯科特 / 苏珊·萨兰登、吉娜·戴维斯": "Ridley Scott / Susan Sarandon, Geena Davis",
  "进园后不远的法院塔（Courthouse Towers）一带，公园大道观景点往北": "Around Courthouse Towers, a short drive into the park and north of the Park Avenue Viewpoint",
  "两人超速被州警拦下，反过来缴了他的枪、把他锁进警车后备箱的那场戏。画面是一条空荡的公路，路边是高耸的砂岩塔和岩墙。": "The scene where a state trooper pulls the two women over for speeding, and they end up taking his gun and locking him in the trunk of his patrol car. The frame is an empty highway lined with towering sandstone spires and walls.",
  "进园后沿主路上坡，先到公园大道停车场，再往北开约 2 公里到法院塔一带的路边停车处。拍的人站在路边停车处里，用中长焦把公路、车和后面的砂岩塔一起拍；下午到傍晚太阳在西边，岩塔正面被照亮。": "From the entrance, follow the main road uphill to the Park Avenue parking area, then continue north about 1.2 miles to the roadside pullouts near Courthouse Towers. Stand inside the pullout and use a medium-telephoto lens to frame the road, your car, and the sandstone towers behind. From afternoon into evening the sun is in the west and lights up the faces of the towers.",
  "只在正规的停车处停车，别把车停在主路上摆拍；园内主路车多，下车先看后方来车。": "Park only in designated pullouts, never on the main road to stage a shot. The park road is busy, so check for traffic behind you before you get out.",
  "公园大道观景台到法院塔之间有一条约 1.6 公里的谷底步道，单程走过去能慢慢找角度，安排人到另一头接。": "A trail of about 1 mile runs along the canyon floor between the Park Avenue Viewpoint and Courthouse Towers. Walk it one way to take your time with angles, and have someone pick you up at the other end.",
  "Moab 旅游局写了这部片在拱门国家公园拍过；具体在法院塔拍警察这场戏，只有犹他州旅游局一家写明。片尾那场戏在死马点州立公园外的 Fossil Point，不在收录范围。": "Moab's tourism office says the film shot in Arches National Park; only the Utah Office of Tourism says the trooper scene was filmed at Courthouse Towers. The final scene was shot at Fossil Point, outside Dead Horse Point State Park, and isn't included here.",
  "吴宇森 / 汤姆·克鲁斯": "John Woo / Tom Cruise",
  "死马点州立公园（犹他州立公园，不在峡谷地国家公园里，在去天空之岛的路上）": "Dead Horse Point State Park (a Utah state park on the way to Island in the Sky, not part of Canyonlands National Park)",
  "吴宇森执导的开场：伊森·亨特在度假，不系保护徒手攀在几百米高的红色崖壁上，身下是科罗拉多河绕出的大弯；爬到崖顶后，直升机送来藏着任务的墨镜。": "John Woo's opening sequence: Ethan Hunt, on vacation, free-climbs a red cliff hundreds of feet high with no protection, the Colorado River's great bend far below. When he reaches the top, a helicopter delivers his mission, hidden in a pair of sunglasses.",
  "开到州立公园最里面的 Dead Horse Point 观景台，往下看就是片中那种红崖加马蹄弯的背景。拍的人站在观景台护栏里侧，被拍的人背靠护栏、侧身做“刚爬上来”的动作，用广角把下面的河弯收进来；日出时河弯在阴影里、远处崖壁先亮，日落前一小时整片崖壁最红。": "Drive to the Dead Horse Point Overlook at the far end of the state park. The view down is the film's backdrop: red cliffs and a horseshoe bend in the river. The photographer stays inside the railing; your subject leans back against it, turned sideways as if they've just topped out, and a wide-angle lens takes in the bend below. At sunrise the bend is in shadow and the far cliffs light up first; in the hour before sunset the whole wall glows red.",
  "不要模仿攀崖：只在护栏里侧拍，崖边砂岩风化松脆，一碰就掉，每年都有人在 Moab 一带坠崖。": "Don't imitate the climb. Shoot only from inside the railing: the sandstone at the rim is weathered and crumbles at a touch, and people fall from cliffs around Moab every year.",
  "州立公园另收门票，2026 年每辆车 20 美元，国家公园年卡不能用。": "The state park charges its own entrance fee, $20 per vehicle in 2026, and America the Beautiful passes aren't accepted.",
  "园内 East Rim / West Rim 步道沿崖边走，能多找几个看河弯的角度；顺路接着去峡谷地天空之岛。": "The East Rim and West Rim trails follow the cliff edge and give you more angles on the bend. Island in the Sky in Canyonlands is the natural next stop.",
  "确定是在死马点拍的；克鲁斯爬的是哪一面崖壁没有公开，观景台只是能看到同样背景的地方。": "Dead Horse Point is confirmed as the location, but which cliff face Cruise climbed has never been made public. The overlook is simply a place with the same backdrop.",
  "埃文·蕾切尔·伍德 / 安东尼·霍普金斯": "Evan Rachel Wood / Anthony Hopkins",
  "死马点州立公园（犹他州立公园，不在峡谷地国家公园里，在去天空之岛的路上）和峡谷地国家公园一带": "Dead Horse Point State Park (a Utah state park on the way to Island in the Sky, not part of Canyonlands National Park) and the Canyonlands National Park area",
  "HBO 的科幻西部剧：主题乐园里的机器人“接待员”一遍遍过着重来的西部生活。第一季里交代乐园有多大的远景，很多就是死马点、峡谷地一带层层叠叠的红色台地和峡谷。": "HBO's sci-fi Western series: robot “hosts” in a theme park live out the same Wild West days over and over. Many of the first season's wide shots showing how vast the park is are the layered red mesas and canyons around Dead Horse Point and Canyonlands.",
  "开到死马点观景台，或者沿 East Rim / West Rim 步道往两边走几百米，找没有护栏和人群入镜的角度，用广角把台地和下面科罗拉多河的大弯收进来。日落前一小时崖壁最红；日出时河谷里常有薄雾，最像剧里那种辽阔又有点不真实的感觉。": "Drive to the Dead Horse Point Overlook, or walk a few hundred yards either way along the East Rim or West Rim Trail to find an angle without railings or crowds in the frame. Use a wide-angle lens to take in the mesas and the great bend of the Colorado River below. The cliffs are reddest in the hour before sunset; at sunrise a thin mist often hangs in the river canyon, closest to the show's vast, slightly unreal look.",
  "崖边砂岩风化松脆，离边缘留出几步，别为了构图往前挪。": "The sandstone at the rim is weathered and crumbly. Stay a few steps back from the edge, and don't creep forward for a better composition.",
  "州立公园门票 2026 年每辆车 20 美元，国家公园年卡不能用；峡谷地国家公园另收门票。": "The state park's entrance fee in 2026 is $20 per vehicle, and America the Beautiful passes aren't accepted. Canyonlands National Park charges its own fee.",
  "第一季也在 Moab 东边的 Castle Valley 拍了不少，开 128 号公路时可以顺路转进去看。": "The first season also filmed a lot in Castle Valley, east of Moab. If you're driving Highway 128, it's an easy detour.",
  "犹他州旅游局和犹他电影委员会都写了第一季在死马点州立公园、峡谷地国家公园拍过；具体是哪几集、哪几个镜头没有公开。": "The Utah Office of Tourism and the Utah Film Commission both say the first season filmed in Dead Horse Point State Park and Canyonlands National Park; which episodes and shots hasn't been made public.",
  "峡谷地国家公园天空之岛一带的 Shafer Canyon 观景点，下面是盘山土路 Shafer Trail": "Shafer Canyon Overlook in the Island in the Sky district of Canyonlands National Park, above the switchbacking dirt road known as the Shafer Trail",
  "电影后半段，塞尔玛和路易丝开着那辆绿色的雷鸟敞篷车一路往西逃，车开进一片红色峡谷和台地，四周空无一人，只有土路和峭壁。": "Late in the film, Thelma and Louise keep running west in their green Thunderbird convertible, and the car heads into a landscape of red canyons and mesas with no one else around, nothing but dirt road and sheer cliffs.",
  "进天空之岛的入口站后不远，路左边就是 Shafer Canyon 观景点，走几步到崖边护栏处，往下看是一圈圈盘下峡谷的 Shafer Trail。拍的人站在护栏里侧用中长焦，把盘山路和下面的峡谷收进来，等有越野车开下去时按快门；上午太阳在东边，峡谷里光线最均匀。": "Shafer Canyon Overlook is on the left side of the road just past the Island in the Sky entrance station. Walk a few steps to the railing at the rim and look down at the Shafer Trail looping into the canyon. Stand inside the railing with a medium-telephoto lens to frame the switchbacks and the canyon below, and wait for an off-road vehicle to start down before you take the shot. In the morning the sun is in the east and the light in the canyon is most even.",
  "Shafer Trail 是陡峭的砂石路，要高底盘四驱、有经验再开，多数租车合同不让开；不开下去，在观景点看就够了。": "The Shafer Trail is a steep dirt road that calls for a high-clearance 4WD vehicle and experience, and most rental contracts don't allow it. You don't need to drive it; the view from the overlook is enough.",
  "峡谷地国家公园门票每车 30 美元，国家公园年卡可用。": "Canyonlands National Park admission is $30 per vehicle, and America the Beautiful passes are accepted.",
  "片尾的悬崖戏在死马点州立公园外的 Fossil Point，属于结局，这里不写。": "The cliff scene at the end of the film was shot at Fossil Point, outside Dead Horse Point State Park. It's the ending, so we leave it out here.",
  "Moab 旅游局把 Shafer Overlook 列为取景地，Wilderness Society 写了后半段的荒漠戏在峡谷地拍；具体是哪一场没查到。": "Moab's tourism office lists Shafer Overlook as a filming location, and The Wilderness Society says the desert scenes in the second half were shot in Canyonlands; we couldn't find which scene was filmed here.",
  "乔治·罗伊·希尔 / 保罗·纽曼、罗伯特·雷德福": "George Roy Hill / Paul Newman, Robert Redford",
  "锡安峡谷里的维珍河边（具体河段没有公开）；园区西北角的科罗布一带也拍过": "Along the Virgin River in Zion Canyon (the exact stretch hasn't been made public); the Kolob area in the park's northwest corner was also used",
  "两个西部大盗布奇和圣丹斯被一路追捕。片中有一段两人并排骑着马，沿锡安峡谷的维珍河往前走，两边是高耸的红色岩壁。": "Western outlaws Butch and Sundance are being hunted down by a relentless posse. In one sequence the two ride side by side along the Virgin River in Zion Canyon, between towering red walls.",
  "从游客中心出发的 Pa'rus 步道沿着维珍河走，平缓好走，河对岸就是锡安峡谷的岩壁。走到步道中段的小桥上往峡谷深处看，用中焦把河、两岸的棉白杨和远处的岩峰一起拍。早上峡谷背阴、岩壁偏冷色；下午太阳偏西，岩壁被照成橙红色。": "The Pa'rus Trail starts at the visitor center and follows the Virgin River. It's flat and easy, with the walls of Zion Canyon across the river. From the small bridge midway along the trail, look up the canyon and use a medium focal length to frame the river, the cottonwoods on both banks, and the distant peaks. In the morning the canyon is in shade and the walls look cool; in the afternoon, as the sun moves west, the walls turn orange-red.",
  "班车季锡安峡谷景观道不让私家车进，Pa'rus 步道从游客中心走过去就行，不用坐班车。": "During shuttle season, private cars aren't allowed on the Zion Canyon Scenic Drive, but you can walk to the Pa'rus Trail from the visitor center without taking the shuttle.",
  "想骑马同款，园内有特许经营的骑马团，线路和季节以官网为准。": "For a horseback version, a park concessioner runs guided trail rides; check its official site for routes and seasons.",
  "片中骑自行车那场在园外的 Grafton 鬼镇，可以出园后顺路去。": "The bicycle scene was filmed in the ghost town of Grafton, outside the park, an easy stop after you leave.",
  "犹他州旅游局写了两人沿维珍河骑马这段在锡安峡谷拍，雷德福也说过锡安是片中最好的外景之一；具体在哪段河没查到。科罗布这边犹他州旅游局说是布奇的藏身地，在 Cave Valley 一带拍了他和手下争老大的戏。": "The Utah Office of Tourism says the riding sequence along the Virgin River was filmed in Zion Canyon, and Redford has called Zion one of the film's best locations; we couldn't find which stretch of river. As for Kolob, the Utah Office of Tourism says it stood in for Butch's hideout, and the scene where he fights one of his men for leadership of the gang was shot around Cave Valley.",
  "迪恩·帕里索特 / 蒂姆·艾伦、西格妮·韦弗": "Dean Parisot / Tim Allen, Sigourney Weaver",
  "妖精谷州立公园（犹他州立公园，在圆顶礁国家公园东边约 1.5 小时车程，不在国家公园里）": "Goblin Valley State Park (a Utah state park about 1.5 hours' drive east of Capitol Reef, not part of the national park)",
  "一群过气科幻剧演员被真外星人请去“救场”，传送到一颗陌生星球上找零件。外星球的地面就是这里成片的蘑菇状红色石柱。": "A cast of washed-up sci-fi TV actors gets recruited by real aliens to save the day and beamed down to a strange planet to hunt for a replacement part. That alien ground is this valley's field of red, mushroom-shaped hoodoos.",
  "从观景台停车场走下坡，进第一片谷地（Valley 1）就是满地石柱，可以随便在石柱间走。拍外星球感：人站在两三根高石柱之间，拍的人蹲低、用广角往上拍，把石柱的“蘑菇头”和天空一起收进来；傍晚斜光下石柱影子最长，阴天反而更像外星。": "From the overlook parking lot, walk downhill into the first valley (Valley 1), which is packed with hoodoos you're free to wander among. For an alien-planet look, have your subject stand between two or three tall hoodoos while you crouch low and shoot up with a wide-angle lens, catching the “mushroom caps” against the sky. Low evening light throws the longest shadows, and an overcast day looks even more otherworldly.",
  "别爬到石柱顶上、也别坐在“蘑菇头”上：石柱很脆，2013 年有人推倒石柱被起诉。": "Don't climb on top of the hoodoos or sit on their “mushroom caps.” The rock is fragile, and in 2013 people who pushed one over were prosecuted.",
  "夏天中午谷底没有遮阴，很热；附近的 Little Wild Horse Canyon 片中也拍过，是好走的窄缝峡谷，雨天别进。": "The valley floor has no shade and gets very hot at midday in summer. Nearby Little Wild Horse Canyon, also used in the film, is an easy slot canyon; stay out of it when it rains.",
  "乔治·卢卡斯 / 马克·哈米尔": "George Lucas / Mark Hamill",
  "Artists Drive 景观道中途的艺术家调色板停车场下方": "Below the Artists Palette parking area, midway along the Artists Drive scenic loop",
  "塔图因星球上，R2-D2 独自走进一条峡谷，被躲在岩石后的爪哇人（Jawa）用电击枪击倒、抬上沙漠爬行者。拍的是停车场左下方的棕色干沟，远处巨大的沙漠爬行者是后期画上去的。": "On Tatooine, R2-D2 rolls alone into a canyon, where Jawas hiding in the rocks knock him out with an ion blaster and haul him off to their sandcrawler. The scene was filmed in the brown wash below and to the left of the parking area; the giant sandcrawler in the distance was painted in afterward.",
  "从 Badwater Road 南口进单行的 Artists Drive，开到 Artists Palette 停车场。站在停车场边往下看左手边的棕色干沟，就是 R2-D2 走进去的地方；停车场南边转弯处的碎石坡是爪哇人抬着它走的路线。下午 3 点以后光打在彩色山坡上，粉绿色最明显。": "Enter one-way Artists Drive from its south end on Badwater Road and drive to the Artists Palette parking area. From the edge of the lot, look down at the brown wash on your left: that's where R2-D2 rolls in. The gravel slope at the bend just south of the lot is the route the Jawas take as they carry him away. After 3 p.m. the light falls across the colored hills and the pinks and greens show best.",
  "Artists Drive 单行，只能从南口进、北口出；车长超过 25 英尺（约 7.6 米）不能进。": "Artists Drive is one-way: enter at the south end and exit at the north. Vehicles longer than 25 feet aren't allowed.",
  "可以走下停车场到干沟里，但这片彩色岩层很脆，别踩到坡面上；夏天中午地表能到 70°C 以上，上午或傍晚再去。": "You can walk down from the lot into the wash, but the colorful rock layers are fragile, so stay off the slopes. At midday in summer the ground can top 158°F; go in the morning or evening instead.",
  "NPS App 里有一条免费的《星球大战》取景地自驾语音导览，进园前下载好，园内多数地方没信号。": "The NPS App has a free self-guided Star Wars driving audio tour. Download it before you arrive, since most of the park has no cell service.",
  "乔治·卢卡斯 / 亚历克·吉尼斯": "George Lucas / Alec Guinness",
  "但丁观景台，俯瞰恶水盆地": "Dante's View, overlooking Badwater Basin",
  "欧比旺带卢克站在崖边，俯瞰远处的莫斯艾斯利太空港，说那里是银河系里最乌烟瘴气的地方。画面下方的盐滩就是恶水盆地，太空港的建筑和道路是后期画上去的。": "Obi-Wan stands with Luke at the edge of a cliff above the distant Mos Eisley spaceport and warns him there's no more wretched place in the galaxy. The salt flats below are Badwater Basin; the spaceport's buildings and roads were painted in afterward.",
  "从 190 号公路转进 Dantes View Road 开到山顶停车场，往南走几分钟到观景台边。被拍的人站在观景台平台上背对镜头、看向下方白色的恶水盆地，拍的人退后用中焦，把人和下面的盐滩一起拍；日出时太阳从背后升起，盆地对面的 Telescope Peak 先亮，最像电影的冷色调。": "From Highway 190, take Dante's View Road to the parking lot at the top and walk a few minutes south to the edge of the viewpoint. Your subject stands on the platform with their back to the camera, looking down at the white floor of Badwater Basin, while you step back and use a medium focal length to frame them with the salt flats below. At sunrise the sun comes up behind you and Telescope Peak, across the basin, lights up first, the closest match to the film's cool tones.",
  "最后一段路又窄又陡，车长超过 25 英尺（约 7.6 米）不能上去。": "The last stretch of road is narrow and steep, and vehicles longer than 25 feet aren't allowed.",
  "山顶海拔约 1,669 米，比谷底凉十几度，风大，冬天早上带厚外套。": "The top sits at about 5,480 feet, roughly 20–30°F cooler than the valley floor, and it's windy. Bring a warm jacket on winter mornings.",
  "平台外面的山脊没有护栏，拍照别往外走。": "The ridge beyond the platform has no railing, so don't wander out onto it for a photo.",
  "乔治·卢卡斯": "George Lucas",
  "Stovepipe Wells 以东的梅斯基特平原沙丘": "Mesquite Flat Sand Dunes, east of Stovepipe Wells",
  "C-3PO 和 R2-D2 坐逃生舱落到塔图因后在沙丘里分道扬镳，R2-D2 独自往远处的山走。塔图因的沙丘戏大多在突尼斯拍，这里补拍了一部分远景。": "After their escape pod lands on Tatooine, C-3PO and R2-D2 split up in the dunes, and R2-D2 heads off alone toward the distant mountains. Most of the Tatooine dune scenes were filmed in Tunisia; some of the wide shots were added here later.",
  "停在 190 号公路边的沙丘停车场，往沙丘里走 15–20 分钟，避开停车场附近被踩乱的沙面。拍的人站在一道沙脊上，让被拍的人（或者你带的 R2-D2 模型）走在下面的沙谷里、背对镜头往远山走，留出大片沙纹；日出后半小时和日落前一小时沙纹影子最立体。": "Park at the dunes lot on Highway 190 and walk 15–20 minutes into the dunes to get past the trampled sand near the lot. Stand on a dune ridge and have your subject (or an R2-D2 figure, if you brought one) walk through the trough below, back to the camera, toward the far mountains, leaving lots of rippled sand in the frame. Half an hour after sunrise and the hour before sunset, the shadows in the ripples give the most depth.",
  "NPS 建议夏天上午 10 点以后别进沙丘徒步；沙丘里没有步道，记好回停车场的方向。": "In summer, the NPS advises against hiking in the dunes after 10 a.m. There are no trails in the dunes, so keep track of the way back to the parking lot.",
  "不能开车上沙丘，可以带自己的滑沙板。": "Driving on the dunes isn't allowed, but you can bring your own sandboard.",
  "NPS 和白宫 2015 年的文章都写了这片沙丘是取景地之一；具体是片中哪几个镜头，只有《星期六晚邮报》一家写明。": "The NPS and a 2015 White House blog post both list these dunes as a filming location; only The Saturday Evening Post says which shots in the film were taken here.",
  "米开朗基罗·安东尼奥尼": "Michelangelo Antonioni",
  "扎布里斯基角观景台和下方的黄色泥岩丘": "Zabriskie Point and the yellow mudstone hills below it",
  "意大利导演安东尼奥尼拍的美国六十年代青年反叛电影，片名就是这个观景点。最有名的一段是一对男女在观景台下起伏的黄色泥岩丘之间漫游，画面里只有光秃秃的土丘和尖尖的 Manly Beacon。": "Italian director Michelangelo Antonioni's film about 1960s American youth in revolt takes its name from this overlook. Its best-known sequence follows a young man and woman wandering through the rolling yellow mudstone hills below the overlook, with nothing in the frame but bare hills and the sharp point of Manly Beacon.",
  "从停车场走几分钟上坡到观景台，往下看就是片中的泥岩丘。想走进画面里，就从观景台走 Badlands Loop 或往金色峡谷方向的步道下到土丘之间，拍的人留在步道高处用长焦往下拍，人放小、让起伏的土丘占满画面。日出时土丘被一点点照亮，最像片中的金黄色。": "Walk a few minutes uphill from the parking lot to the overlook; the mudstone hills below are the ones in the film. To put yourself in the scene, take the Badlands Loop or the trail toward Golden Canyon down among the hills, while the photographer stays high on the trail and shoots down with a telephoto lens, keeping people small and letting the rolling hills fill the frame. At sunrise the hills light up a little at a time, closest to the golden color of the film.",
  "泥岩表面很脆，走现成的步道，别在没路的坡上滑下去，下雨后更滑。": "The mudstone surface is fragile. Stay on established trails and don't slide down slopes where there's no path; they're even more slippery after rain.",
  "从这里走到 Manly Beacon 约 2.4 公里，夏天上午 10 点后别下去，带足水。": "Manly Beacon is about 1.5 miles from here on foot. In summer, don't head down after 10 a.m., and carry plenty of water.",
  "Badwater Road 边金色峡谷（Golden Canyon）步道口往里的一段干沟": "A dry wash leading into the canyon from the Golden Canyon trailhead on Badwater Road",
  "接着艺术家调色板那场：R2-D2 独自滚进一条窄峡谷，爪哇人躲在岩缝里、从大石头后面探头盯着它。镜头里是两侧黄褐色的泥岩壁和满地碎石的干沟。": "Picking up from the Artists Palette scene: R2-D2 rolls alone into a narrow canyon while Jawas hide in the cracks, peering at him from behind boulders. The frame shows yellow-brown mudstone walls on both sides and a wash full of loose rock.",
  "从 190 号公路转进 Badwater Road 往南约 3 公里，路东边就是 Golden Canyon 停车场。沿干沟往里走十几分钟，两侧岩壁收窄、有大石块的地方最像片中。拍的人站在干沟中间、蹲低往上游拍，让被拍的人（或者你带的 R2-D2 模型）走在画面中下部，两侧岩壁做框。上午谷里背阴、光线均匀；下午太阳照进来，岩壁发金。": "From Highway 190, take Badwater Road about 2 miles south; the Golden Canyon parking lot is on the east side of the road. Walk up the wash for 10–15 minutes to where the walls narrow and big boulders appear, the closest match to the film. The photographer stands in the middle of the wash, crouches, and shoots upcanyon, with your subject (or an R2-D2 figure, if you brought one) in the lower middle of the frame and the walls framing both sides. In the morning the canyon is in shade and the light is even; in the afternoon the sun reaches in and the walls glow gold.",
  "岩缝和石头底下可能有蝎子和响尾蛇，别把手伸进看不到的缝里。": "Scorpions and rattlesnakes may be in cracks and under rocks, so don't reach into places you can't see.",
  "夏天谷底很热、没有遮阴，5–9 月上午 10 点以后别进，带足水。": "The canyon floor gets very hot in summer and has no shade. From May through September, don't go in after 10 a.m., and carry plenty of water.",
  "沿步道继续往里走约 2.5 公里能到红色大教堂（Red Cathedral），也有步道接到扎布里斯基角。": "Continue about 1.5 miles up the trail to reach Red Cathedral; another trail connects to Zabriskie Point.",
  "白宫 2015 年的文章写了金色峡谷是取景地之一；具体是片中哪几个镜头，只有《星期六晚邮报》一家写明。": "A 2015 White House blog post lists Golden Canyon as one of the filming locations; only The Saturday Evening Post says which shots in the film were taken here.",
  "Badwater Road 东侧、金色峡谷以南的荒凉峡谷（Desolation Canyon）": "Desolation Canyon, off the east side of Badwater Road south of Golden Canyon",
  "沙人（塔斯肯袭击者）冲回去骑上班萨兽的那场在这里拍；卢克举着望远镜看远处的沙人时，镜头里也是这条峡谷的谷口。": "The scene where the Sand People (Tusken Raiders) run back and mount their banthas was filmed here. When Luke watches the Sand People through his binoculars, the view is the mouth of this canyon too.",
  "从 Badwater Road 转进一条短砂石路到停车处，沿干沟往东走进峡谷。想拍“卢克举望远镜”的画面，就在谷口外的高处，让被拍的人举着望远镜朝谷里看，拍的人在侧后方用中焦把人和远处的谷口一起拍。谷口朝西，下午顺光，岩壁的颜色最清楚。": "Turn off Badwater Road onto a short gravel road to the parking area, then follow the wash east into the canyon. For the shot of Luke with his binoculars, find higher ground outside the canyon mouth and have your subject hold binoculars up toward the canyon, while the photographer shoots from behind and to one side with a medium focal length, framing the person and the distant canyon mouth. The canyon mouth faces west, so afternoon light falls on it and shows the colors of the walls best.",
  "峡谷里没有修整的步道，往里有几处要手脚并用爬过干瀑布，没把握就在谷口拍。": "There's no maintained trail in the canyon, and farther in you'll need to scramble over a few dry falls using your hands. If you're not confident, stay at the canyon mouth.",
  "夏天 5–9 月上午 10 点以后别进；这里是荒野区，不能开车进去，也不能飞无人机。": "From May through September, don't go in after 10 a.m. This is designated wilderness: no driving in and no drones.",
  "砂石路一般小轿车能开，下过雨先问游客中心。": "The gravel road is usually fine for a regular car; after rain, check at the visitor center first.",
  "白宫 2015 年的文章写了荒凉峡谷是取景地之一；具体是片中哪几个镜头，只有《星期六晚邮报》一家写明。": "A 2015 White House blog post lists Desolation Canyon as one of the filming locations; only The Saturday Evening Post says which shots in the film were taken here.",
  "理查德·马昆德 / 安东尼·丹尼尔斯": "Richard Marquand / Anthony Daniels",
  "190 号公路南侧的二十骡队峡谷（Twenty Mule Team Canyon）单行土路，扎布里斯基角东边": "Twenty Mule Team Canyon, a one-way dirt road off the south side of Highway 190, east of Zabriskie Point",
  "开场不久，C-3PO 和 R2-D2 走在去贾巴宫殿的路上，一路嘀嘀咕咕，路两边是起伏的荒山。画面里的“路”其实是两侧夹着土丘的干沟。": "Early in the film, C-3PO and R2-D2 make their way to Jabba's palace, bickering the whole way, with rolling barren hills on either side. The “road” in the shot is actually a wash between mud hills.",
  "入口在扎布里斯基角东边、190 号公路南侧，是一条约 4 公里的单行土路，绕一圈回到 190 号公路。在两侧土丘最高、路看得最远的地方找宽处停车，拍的人站在路边高一点的地方往下拍，让被拍的人沿着干沟走向远处。早上土丘被侧光照亮，黄褐色的层理最清楚。": "The entrance is on the south side of Highway 190, east of Zabriskie Point. It's a one-way dirt road about 2.5 miles long that loops back to Highway 190. Pull over in a wide spot where the hills on either side are highest and you can see farthest down the road. The photographer stands on higher ground at the roadside and shoots down as your subject walks along the wash into the distance. Morning side light shows the yellow-brown layers most clearly.",
  "一般小轿车能开，特别低的车不建议；下雨后可能封路，出发前问游客中心。": "Most regular cars can handle it, but very low cars aren't recommended. The road may close after rain, so check at the visitor center before you go.",
  "单行路，只在宽处停车，别把车停在弯道上；夏天车里也备足水。": "It's one-way; stop only in wide spots, never on a curve. In summer, keep plenty of water in the car too.",
  "蓝光版删减片段里卢克组装光剑的小山洞也在这条峡谷，NPS 说洞已经因为安全原因封闭，别进去。": "The small cave where Luke builds his lightsaber in a deleted scene on the Blu-ray is also in this canyon. The NPS says the cave has been closed for safety reasons, so don't go in.",
  "斯坦利·库布里克 / 杰克·尼科尔森": "Stanley Kubrick / Jack Nicholson",
  "圣玛丽湖和湖北岸的向阳大道东段，野鹅岛观景台一带": "St. Mary Lake and the east side of Going-to-the-Sun Road along its north shore, around Wild Goose Island Overlook",
  "片头字幕：航拍镜头贴着平静的湖面飞过湖中的小岛，再追上一辆在山路上开的黄色甲壳虫，一家三口正开往山上的酒店，配着阴森的音乐。": "The opening credits: an aerial shot skims the calm lake past a small island, then catches up with a yellow Volkswagen Beetle winding along a mountain road, carrying a family of three to a hotel in the mountains, all to an ominous score.",
  "开向阳大道东段到 Rising Sun 以西的野鹅岛观景台，路边停车走几步就到。片头那种“湖、小岛、远山”的画面，用中焦对准湖中小岛，把两侧山峰收进来；想加上片中的公路，往东退到能看见湖边公路的弯道处。清晨无风时湖面最平，最像片头。": "Drive the east side of Going-to-the-Sun Road to Wild Goose Island Overlook, west of Rising Sun; it's a few steps from the roadside parking. For the opening's lake, island, and distant peaks, aim a medium focal length at the island and take in the mountains on both sides. To add the road from the film, back up east to a curve where you can see the road along the lake. The lake is glassiest on a calm early morning, closest to the opening shot.",
  "国家公园内禁止飞无人机，航拍同款拍不了，靠地面机位。": "Drones are banned in national parks, so the aerial shot is off the table; work from the ground.",
  "春季扫雪后东段一般 6 月前后才通到这里，以 NPS 路况为准；2026 年进园不用预约。": "After spring plowing, the east side usually opens this far around June; check NPS road status. No entry reservation is needed in 2026.",
  "拍公路时人和车都待在停车处里，别在弯道上停车。": "When you photograph the road, keep people and cars in the pullout, and don't stop on curves.",
  "片头是直升机航拍，地面上没有一样的机位；野鹅岛观景台是看同一片湖面最近的地方。片中的酒店外景在俄勒冈州的 Timberline Lodge，不在这里。": "The opening was shot from a helicopter, so no spot on the ground matches it exactly; Wild Goose Island Overlook is the closest view of the same stretch of lake. The hotel exteriors were filmed at Timberline Lodge in Oregon, not here.",
  "向阳大道东段沿圣玛丽湖的一段": "The east side of Going-to-the-Sun Road along St. Mary Lake",
  "阿甘长跑横穿美国的蒙太奇里，有一段他跑在山间公路上，背后是雪山和圣玛丽湖；旁白里说山里的湖静得像有两个天空。": "In Forrest's cross-country running montage, one stretch has him running a mountain road with snowy peaks and St. Mary Lake behind him. In the voice-over, he says the mountain lakes were so still it looked like there were two skies.",
  "在 St. Mary 入口到 Rising Sun、野鹅岛观景台之间，找路边的停车处。拍的人站在停车处里，用长焦把公路弯道、湖面和背后的山压在一起，被拍的人在路肩外的停车处里做跑步动作。早上逆光、湖面最平；下午顺光，山体颜色更清楚。": "Look for a roadside pullout between the St. Mary Entrance and Rising Sun or Wild Goose Island Overlook. The photographer stands in the pullout and uses a telephoto lens to stack the curving road, the lake, and the mountains behind. Your runner strikes a running pose inside the pullout, off the road. Mornings are backlit and the lake is calmest; in the afternoon the light is behind you and the mountains show more color.",
  "不要在向阳大道的车道上跑步摆拍：路窄弯多、夏天车很多，只在停车处里拍。": "Don't stage running shots in the travel lanes of Going-to-the-Sun Road. It's narrow and winding and very busy in summer, so shoot only from pullouts.",
  "7–8 月上午 9 点以后到傍晚车多，清晨来最顺；2026 年进园不用预约。": "In July and August, traffic is heavy from 9 a.m. into the evening, so early morning is easiest. No entry reservation is needed in 2026.",
  "确定是向阳大道和圣玛丽湖；阿甘具体跑在哪一段路上没查到可靠的说法，上面写的是能拍到同样背景的路段。": "Going-to-the-Sun Road and St. Mary Lake are confirmed, but we couldn't find a reliable account of exactly which stretch Forrest runs. The section described here is one where you can get the same backdrop.",
  "赵婷 / 弗兰西斯·麦克多蒙德": "Chloé Zhao / Frances McDormand",
  "Wall 镇主街的 Wall Drug 杂货铺（私人商店，不在恶地国家公园里）": "Wall Drug Store on Main Street in Wall (a private business, not part of Badlands National Park)",
  "华人导演赵婷拿下奥斯卡最佳影片和最佳导演的电影。电影一开拍就在南达科他：女主角弗恩一路打零工，有一段在 Wall Drug 干活，戴着店里那种纸帽子。": "Chloé Zhao's film won the Oscars for Best Picture and Best Director, and filming began in South Dakota. Fern, the main character, drifts from one temporary job to the next, and for a stretch she works at Wall Drug, wearing one of the store's paper hats.",
  "Wall 镇就在 I-90 边上，离恶地国家公园 Pinnacles 入口约 15 分钟。店里几条走廊连着餐厅、牛仔用品店和老照片墙，在餐厅一带找有木头装饰和西部招牌的角落拍；主街门口的老招牌下也能拍。白天人多，开门后不久或傍晚人少一些。": "Wall sits right off I-90, about 15 minutes from the Pinnacles Entrance of Badlands National Park. Inside the store, hallways connect the café, a Western wear shop, and walls of old photos. Around the café, look for a corner with wood trim and Western signs; the old signs out front on Main Street work too. Daytime is crowded; it's quieter soon after opening or in the evening.",
  "店里拍照没问题，但别对着店员和其他顾客的脸拍。": "Taking photos in the store is fine, but don't point your camera at staff or other customers' faces.",
  "冰水仍然免费、咖啡 5 美分；看完恶地的日落回来吃晚饭正好。": "The ice water is still free and coffee is still 5 cents. It's a good place for dinner after a Badlands sunset.",
  "恶地国家公园的岩丘之间（具体哪条步道没有公开）": "Among the formations of Badlands National Park (the exact trail hasn't been made public)",
  "弗恩一个人在恶地的岩丘间徒步，停下来看四周粉色、米色条纹的岩壁。没有台词，只有人和大片荒地。": "Fern hikes alone among the Badlands formations and stops to take in the pink- and cream-banded walls around her. There's no dialogue, just one person and a vast, empty land.",
  "这类画面在 Cedar Pass 一带最容易拍：Door 和 Window 步道、Notch 步道口都在 240 号公路边。人走在步道上、背对镜头，拍的人退远用中长焦，让条纹岩壁占满画面、人只占一小块。日出后一小时和日落前一小时岩壁的粉色最明显。": "The Cedar Pass area is the easiest place to get this kind of shot: the Door, Window, and Notch trailheads are all on Highway 240. Your subject walks the trail with their back to the camera while the photographer stands well back with a medium-telephoto lens, letting the banded walls fill the frame and keeping the person small. The pinks are strongest in the hour after sunrise and the hour before sunset.",
  "Door 步道走过木栈道以后，要沿黄色标杆走，岩丘表面松软，下雨后很滑。": "Past the boardwalk on the Door Trail, follow the yellow marker posts. The ground is soft and gets very slick after rain.",
  "夏天中午岩丘间没有遮阴，带足水；看到响尾蛇绕开走。": "There's no shade among the formations at midday in summer, so carry plenty of water. If you see a rattlesnake, give it a wide berth.",
  "南达科他州旅游局写了这段在恶地国家公园拍，但没说哪条步道；有旅游博客说弗恩做营地管理员的营地是 Cedar Pass 营地，没找到可靠来源，没写进来。": "Travel South Dakota, the state tourism office, says this sequence was filmed in Badlands National Park but doesn't name the trail. A travel blog says the campground where Fern works as a camp host is Cedar Pass Campground; we couldn't find a reliable source for that, so it's left out.",
  "凯文·科斯特纳": "Kevin Costner",
  "恶地国家公园西北部的 Sage Creek 荒野区，Sage Creek Rim Road 沿线": "The Sage Creek wilderness area in the northwest part of Badlands National Park, along Sage Creek Rim Road",
  "邓巴中尉坐着运货马车，从海斯堡出发穿过大草原去偏远的塞奇威克堡。一路是起伏的草原，地平线上是恶地的岩丘。": "Lieutenant Dunbar rides a supply wagon from Fort Hays across the open prairie to remote Fort Sedgwick. The whole way is rolling grassland, with Badlands formations on the horizon.",
  "从 Pinnacles 观景点北边转进 Sage Creek Rim Road（砂石路），沿路有几个路边观景处，一侧是草原、一侧是岩丘。拍的人站在观景处里，用长焦往草原深处拍，等野牛群或远处的砂石路进画面；傍晚太阳低，草原金黄、岩丘有阴影，最像电影的色调。": "Just north of Pinnacles Overlook, turn onto Sage Creek Rim Road (gravel). Several roadside overlooks along the way have prairie on one side and badlands formations on the other. From an overlook, shoot deep into the prairie with a telephoto lens and wait for a bison herd or the distant gravel road to enter the frame. In the evening the low sun turns the grass gold and puts shadows on the formations, closest to the film's palette.",
  "野牛就在路边吃草时也要至少保持 25 码（约 23 米），在车里拍最安全，别下车靠近。": "Even when bison are grazing right beside the road, stay at least 25 yards away. Shooting from your car is safest; don't get out and approach them.",
  "大雨、下雪后砂石路会临时封闭，出发前问游客中心。": "The gravel road may close temporarily after heavy rain or snow. Check at the visitor center before you go.",
  "保罗·范霍文": "Paul Verhoeven",
  "恶地国家公园（具体在哪片岩丘没有公开）": "Badlands National Park (exactly which formations hasn't been made public)",
  "人类联邦的机动步兵到外星球和“虫族”打仗。片中有一场外星球上的激烈战斗，荒凉起伏的灰白色岩丘就是在恶地拍的。": "Mobile Infantry troopers of the human Federation go to war against the alien “Bugs.” A fierce battle on an alien planet was filmed among the Badlands' desolate, rolling, gray-white formations.",
  "这种“外星战场”在 Badlands Loop Road 边的 Pinnacles 观景点、Yellow Mounds 一带最容易拍：观景台往下是一层层尖尖的岩丘。拍的人用长焦压缩远近的岩丘；阴天或傍晚光线低时颜色发灰，最像片里的外星荒原。": "This kind of alien battlefield is easiest to shoot around Pinnacles Overlook and Yellow Mounds along Badlands Loop Road, where rows of sharp formations fall away below the overlook. Use a telephoto lens to compress near and far formations. On overcast days or in low evening light the colors turn gray, closest to the film's alien wasteland.",
  "观景台外面的岩丘很松软，下雨后又滑又黏，别翻出去爬。": "The formations beyond the overlooks are soft and crumbly and turn slick and sticky after rain. Don't climb over the edge to scramble on them.",
  "夏天午后常有雷暴，空旷的观景台上看到闪电就回车里。": "Afternoon thunderstorms are common in summer. If you see lightning, leave the exposed overlook and get back in your car.",
  "乔治·伊士曼博物馆的放映介绍写了外星球上的战斗在恶地国家公园拍；也有文章说外星球的镜头主要在怀俄明的 Hell's Half Acre 拍，可能两边都拍过。": "The George Eastman Museum's screening notes say the alien-planet battle was filmed in Badlands National Park. Some articles say the alien-planet scenes were mostly shot at Hell's Half Acre in Wyoming; the production may have filmed in both places.",
  "阿尔弗雷德·希区柯克 / 加里·格兰特": "Alfred Hitchcock / Cary Grant",
  "拉什莫尔山国家纪念地的观景平台和停车场（当年拍戏的餐厅和游客中心 1994 年拆了）": "The viewing terraces and parking area at Mount Rushmore National Memorial (the café and visitor center where the scenes were filmed were torn down in 1994)",
  "广告人罗杰被误认成间谍，一路被追到南达科他。在拉什莫尔山，他和伊芙在观景餐厅里见面，窗外就是四位总统的巨像，这里发生的一场意外让剧情急转。剧组在餐厅、停车场和几处观景平台拍了两天；片尾在头像上攀爬追逐那段是在摄影棚里搭的假山上拍的，NPS 当年不允许在雕像上拍暴力戏。": "Ad man Roger is mistaken for a spy and chased all the way to South Dakota. At Mount Rushmore he meets Eve in the memorial's café, with the four giant presidential faces outside the window, and an incident there sends the story in a sharp new direction. The crew spent two days filming in the café, the parking lot, and on several viewing terraces. The chase across the faces near the end was shot on a mock-up built in a studio; at the time, the NPS wouldn't allow violent scenes to be filmed on the sculpture.",
  "从停车场穿过旗帜大道（Avenue of Flags）走到 Grand View Terrace 观景平台，正对四位总统头像。拍的人站在平台后方，被拍的人站在护栏前、侧身回头，把人和头像一起收进来。头像朝东南，上午顺光最清楚，傍晚头像背光。": "From the parking area, walk through the Avenue of Flags to the Grand View Terrace, which looks straight at the four faces. The photographer stands at the back of the terrace while your subject stands at the railing, turned sideways and looking back, so both the person and the faces are in the frame. The faces look southeast, so they're best lit in the morning; by evening they're backlit.",
  "纪念地不收门票，但停车要另付停车费，国家公园年卡不能抵。": "The memorial doesn't charge admission, but parking is a separate fee, and America the Beautiful passes don't cover it.",
  "Presidential Trail 能走到离头像近一些的地方，只能走步道，不能往山上爬。": "The Presidential Trail takes you closer to the faces. Stay on the trail; climbing the mountain isn't allowed.",
  "片中的餐厅已经不在了，现在的餐厅是后来新建的，位置也不一样。": "The café from the film is gone. Today's restaurant was built later, in a different spot.",
  "史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格 / 杰夫·高布伦": "Steven Spielberg / Jeff Goldblum",
  "草原溪红杉州立公园（Prairie Creek Redwoods）的蕨类峡谷，属红木国家和州立公园": "Fern Canyon in Prairie Creek Redwoods State Park, part of Redwood National and State Parks",
  "猎人队里有人掉队，独自走进一条两侧长满蕨类的窄峡谷，一群小型恐龙从溪边围上来。画面里是十几米高、整面垂着蕨类的岩壁和浅浅的溪床。": "A member of the hunting party falls behind and wanders alone into a narrow, fern-lined canyon, where a pack of small dinosaurs closes in from the creek. The frame is 30- to 60-foot walls draped in ferns above a shallow creek bed.",
  "开 Davison Road（约 8 英里单车道土路）到尽头的 Fern Canyon 停车场，走几分钟进峡谷口。往里走 100–200 米、两侧岩壁最高最窄的地方，拍的人站在溪床下游往上游拍，让被拍的人走在溪水中间、两边全是蕨类。阴天或上午光线柔，岩壁不会一半亮一半暗。": "Drive Davison Road (about 8 miles of single-lane dirt road) to the Fern Canyon parking lot at the end, then walk a few minutes to the canyon mouth. About 100–200 yards in, where the walls are tallest and narrowest, the photographer stands downstream in the creek bed and shoots upstream as your subject walks up the middle of the creek, ferns on both sides. Overcast days and mornings give soft light, so the walls aren't half bright and half dark.",
  "5 月 15 日到 9 月 15 日开车进 Davison Road 要提前在网上预约，免费；走路进来不用预约。": "From May 15 to September 15, driving Davison Road requires a free advance reservation online. Walking in doesn't.",
  "要在溪水里走、翻倒木，穿能湿水的鞋；路上要涉水过两条小溪，底盘低的车容易卡住。": "You'll be walking in the creek and climbing over fallen logs, so wear shoes that can get wet. The road fords two small creeks, and low-clearance cars can get stuck.",
  "蕨类和苔藓很娇气，别扯、别爬岩壁。": "The ferns and moss are delicate. Don't pull on them or climb the walls.",
  "威廉·夏特纳 / 伦纳德·尼莫伊": "William Shatner / Leonard Nimoy",
  "优胜美地山谷的酋长岩": "El Capitan in Yosemite Valley",
  "开场柯克舰长休假，在酋长岩上徒手攀岩，斯波克穿着火箭靴飘到他身边聊天。远景是真的酋长岩，柯克的近景是在搭出来的假岩壁上拍的。": "The film opens with Captain Kirk on shore leave, free-climbing El Capitan, when Spock floats up beside him in rocket boots to chat. The wide shots are the real El Capitan; Kirk's close-ups were filmed on a constructed rock wall.",
  "在 Northside Drive 边的酋长岩草甸（El Capitan Meadow）停车，从草甸抬头看整面岩壁。拍的人用长焦对准岩壁中段，常能拍到挂在壁上的攀岩者，最有片中“人在巨壁上”的感觉；傍晚太阳偏西，岩壁被照成橙色。": "Park at El Capitan Meadow on Northside Drive and look up at the whole face from the meadow. Aim a telephoto lens at the middle of the wall and you'll often catch climbers hanging on it, the best way to get the film's tiny-figure-on-a-giant-wall feel. In the evening, as the sun moves west, the wall glows orange.",
  "带望远镜找岩壁上的攀岩者和过夜吊帐；沿草甸边的现成小路走，别踩进湿草甸。": "Bring binoculars to spot climbers and their portaledges on the wall. Stick to the established paths along the edge of the meadow and stay out of the wet meadow itself.",
  "不要去岩壁脚下的乱石坡“摆攀岩姿势”，上面常有落石。": "Don't scramble up the talus at the base of the wall to “pose” as a climber; rockfall there is common.",
  "金国威、伊丽莎白·柴·瓦沙瑞莉 / 亚历克斯·霍诺尔德": "Jimmy Chin, Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi / Alex Honnold",
  "优胜美地山谷的酋长岩西南面": "The southwest face of El Capitan in Yosemite Valley",
  "华裔攀岩摄影师金国威和妻子执导的纪录片，拿了奥斯卡最佳纪录长片：霍诺尔德 2017 年 6 月不带绳子、不带保护，沿 Freerider 路线爬上约 900 米高的酋长岩。镜头里是人贴在巨大花岗岩壁上的画面。": "Directed by climber and photographer Jimmy Chin and his wife, Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi, this documentary won the Oscar for Best Documentary Feature. In June 2017, Honnold climbs El Capitan, about 3,000 feet high, by the Freerider route with no rope and no protection. The footage shows one person pressed against an enormous granite wall.",
  "在酋长岩草甸往北看，Freerider 这条线在岩壁西南面（偏左的一侧）。拍的人用长焦，从草甸或 Northside Drive 边的停车处对准岩壁，等攀岩者进画面；想拍整面岩壁和山谷，就去隧道观景点或山谷景观点（Valley View）。上午岩壁背光偏冷色，傍晚被照成橙色。": "Looking north from El Capitan Meadow, Freerider runs up the southwest face, the left-hand side of the wall. From the meadow or a pullout on Northside Drive, aim a telephoto lens at the wall and wait for climbers to move into the frame. For the whole wall and the valley, go to Tunnel View or Valley View. In the morning the wall is backlit and cool-toned; by evening it glows orange.",
  "片中是顶尖攀岩者准备多年后的极限挑战，别去岩壁脚下尝试任何攀爬；想体验可以报优胜美地攀岩学校的入门课。": "The film shows an elite climber taking on an extreme challenge after years of preparation. Don't try any climbing at the base of the wall; for a taste of it, sign up for an intro class with Yosemite Mountaineering School.",
  "春夏常能看到挂在岩壁上的攀岩队伍，带望远镜。": "In spring and summer you'll often see climbing teams on the wall, so bring binoculars.",
  "西尔维斯特·史泰龙": "Sylvester Stallone",
  "大提顿国家公园摩门街（Mormon Row）北边的 Antelope Flats 草原": "Antelope Flats, north of Mormon Row in Grand Teton National Park",
  "洛奇去“苏联西伯利亚”备战：在齐膝深的雪里跑步、劈柴、拉雪橇，背后是一排雪山。那个西伯利亚小村其实是搭在摩门街北边的布景，雪山是提顿群峰。": "Rocky trains in “Soviet Siberia”: running through knee-deep snow, chopping wood, and hauling a sled, with a line of snowy peaks behind him. That Siberian village was actually a set built north of Mormon Row, and the peaks are the Tetons.",
  "夏秋开 Antelope Flats Road 到摩门街，往北走一段，找前景没有谷仓、只有草原和提顿群峰的角度。拍的人退远用长焦，让人在雪地或草地里跑向镜头、背后是群峰；日出时群峰先被照亮，冬天雪后最像片中。": "In summer and fall, drive Antelope Flats Road to Mormon Row and walk north a ways to find an angle with no barns in the foreground, just grassland and the Tetons. Back well off with a telephoto lens and have your subject run toward the camera through snow or grass with the peaks behind. At sunrise the peaks light up first, and after a winter snowfall it looks most like the film.",
  "积雪后（大约 12 月到次年 3 月）Antelope Flats Road 不扫雪，车开不进来，只能停在 191 号公路边，步行、滑雪或穿雪鞋约 3 公里进去。": "Once snow covers it (roughly December through March), Antelope Flats Road isn't plowed and you can't drive in. Park along Highway 191 and walk, ski, or snowshoe about 2 miles in.",
  "野牛就在路边时也要保持 25 码（约 23 米）以上；冬天这里常是零下二十几度，片场当年冻坏过器材，手机电池也要保暖。": "Stay at least 25 yards from bison, even when they're right by the road. Winter temperatures here often fall to between -4°F and -20°F; the cold damaged equipment during the original shoot, so keep your phone battery warm.",
  "布景拍完就拆了，现在只剩草原。": "The set was taken down after filming; today there's only open grassland.",
  "白宫 2015 年的文章写了大提顿是片中的“俄罗斯雪原”；布景搭在摩门街北边，只有怀俄明的 Cowboy State Daily 一家写明，具体位置没有公开。": "A 2015 White House blog post identified Grand Teton as the film's “Russian snowfields.” Only Wyoming's Cowboy State Daily says the set stood north of Mormon Row, and the exact spot hasn't been made public.",
  "杰克逊霍尔滑雪场的 Cody Peak（国家森林里，归 Jackson Hole Mountain Resort 和 Bridger-Teton 国家森林管，不在大提顿国家公园里），坐空中缆车上山能看到": "Cody Peak at Jackson Hole Mountain Resort, visible from the top of the aerial tram (it's national forest land managed by Jackson Hole Mountain Resort and Bridger-Teton National Forest, not part of Grand Teton National Park)",
  "训练的最后，洛奇一路爬上雪山山顶，张开双臂冲着群山大喊对手的名字。": "At the end of his training, Rocky climbs all the way to a snowy summit, throws his arms wide, and shouts his opponent's name at the mountains.",
  "从 Teton Village 坐空中缆车到 Rendezvous 山顶，在山顶观景平台往南看，旁边的尖峰就是 Cody Peak。山顶平台上就能拍同款：人站在平台护栏里侧、张开双臂对着远山，拍的人蹲低往上拍，把天空和远处的山脊收进来。上午天气最稳定，下午常起云。": "Ride the aerial tram from Teton Village to the top of Rendezvous Mountain and look south from the summit viewing deck; the pointed peak next door is Cody Peak. You can get the shot right on the deck: your subject stands inside the railing with arms flung wide toward the far peaks, while the photographer crouches and shoots up to take in the sky and distant ridgelines. The weather is most settled in the morning; clouds often build in the afternoon.",
  "缆车 2026 年夏季 5 月 16 日到 10 月 4 日运营，要买票；10 月初到 12 月初、4 月到 5 月中旬停运。": "In summer 2026 the tram runs May 16–October 4, and you need a ticket. It doesn't run from early October to early December or from April to mid-May.",
  "不要自己往 Cody Peak 走：那一带是滑雪场边界外的陡坡，冬天有雪崩风险，夏天碎石很滑。": "Don't set out for Cody Peak on your own. It's steep terrain outside the resort boundary, with avalanche danger in winter and slippery loose rock in summer.",
  "山顶海拔 3,185 米，比山下冷得多、风大，夏天也带外套。": "The summit sits at about 10,450 feet and is much colder and windier than the valley below. Bring a jacket even in summer.",
  "山顶这场在 Cody Peak 拍，只有 Cowboy State Daily 一家写明（采访了当年的剧组人员）；部分近景在缆车山顶站附近拍。": "Only Cowboy State Daily, which interviewed members of the original crew, says the summit scene was filmed on Cody Peak. Some close-ups were shot near the tram's summit station.",
  "乔治·史蒂文斯 / 艾伦·拉德": "George Stevens / Alan Ladd",
  "大提顿国家公园东南部 Kelly 一带的 Antelope Flats 草原和 Kelly Warm Springs，摩门街往东南约 5 公里": "Antelope Flats and Kelly Warm Springs near Kelly, in the southeast part of Grand Teton National Park, about 3 miles southeast of Mormon Row",
  "孤独的枪手沙恩骑马走进山谷、来到拓荒者斯塔雷特一家的农场。片中的小镇和农场都背靠提顿群峰，镜头里群峰几乎一直在背景里。": "Shane, a lone gunfighter, rides into the valley and arrives at the homestead of the Starrett family. Both the town and the farm sit against the Tetons, which stay in the background for nearly the whole film.",
  "开 Antelope Flats Road 往东到 Kelly 方向，路边草原上往西看，提顿群峰正好横在地平线上。拍的人退远用长焦，让人（或骑马的人）走在草原中间、背后是群峰；清晨太阳从背后照亮群峰，最像片中的画面。": "Drive Antelope Flats Road east toward Kelly and look west from the roadside grassland, where the Tetons stretch across the horizon. Back well off with a telephoto lens and have your subject (or a rider on horseback) cross the middle of the flats with the peaks behind. In the early morning the sun comes from behind you and lights up the peaks, the closest match to the film.",
  "布景早已拆掉，片中的小镇只有一座马具店保存下来，在杰克逊霍尔历史协会展出。": "The sets are long gone. Only one building from the film's town survives, a saddle shop now displayed by the Jackson Hole Historical Society.",
  "Antelope Flats Road 冬天不扫雪，12 月到次年 3 月车开不进来；草原上常有野牛和叉角羚，保持距离。": "Antelope Flats Road isn't plowed in winter, so from December through March you can't drive in. Bison and pronghorn often graze the flats; keep your distance.",
  "NPS 写了这部片在大提顿国家公园拍；小镇布景在 Antelope Flats、农场在 Kelly Warm Springs，只有《American Cowboy》杂志一家写明。": "The NPS says the film was shot in Grand Teton National Park. Only American Cowboy magazine says the town set stood on Antelope Flats and the farm at Kelly Warm Springs.",
  "富兰克林·沙夫纳 / 查尔顿·赫斯顿": "Franklin J. Schaffner / Charlton Heston",
  "鲍威尔湖犹他一侧的 Alstrom Point，属格伦峡谷国家休闲区（NPS），对面是 Gunsight Butte": "Alstrom Point on the Utah side of Lake Powell, in Glen Canyon National Recreation Area (NPS), facing Gunsight Butte",
  "宇航员的飞船坠进一片陌生的湖里，几个人坐着橡皮艇逃出来，划向岸边寸草不生的砂岩荒地。背景是湖面和对面方顶的孤峰 Gunsight Butte。": "The astronauts' ship crashes into an unknown lake, and the crew escapes in an inflatable raft, paddling toward a barren sandstone shore. Behind them are the lake and flat-topped Gunsight Butte across the water.",
  "从佩吉往西开 89 号公路到 Big Water，转进 Smoky Mountain Road 等土路，开约 40 公里到 Alstrom Point 崖顶。站在崖顶往东南看，下面是鲍威尔湖的 Padre Bay，对面就是 Gunsight Butte。日出时孤峰和湖面一起被照亮；不想开这么远，坐 Wahweap 的游船也能从湖面上看到这一带。": "From Page, take US-89 west to Big Water, then follow Smoky Mountain Road and other dirt roads about 25 miles to the clifftop at Alstrom Point. Look southeast: below is Lake Powell's Padre Bay, with Gunsight Butte across it. At sunrise the butte and the lake light up together. If that's too long a drive, a boat tour from Wahweap also gives you a view of this area from the water.",
  "最后几公里是岩石路，要高底盘四驱，雨后土路泥泞开不了；手机没信号，带足水和油。": "The last few miles are over rock and need a high-clearance 4WD vehicle, and the dirt roads turn to impassable mud after rain. There's no cell service, so bring plenty of water and a full tank.",
  "崖顶没有护栏，离边缘留够距离，别为了构图往前挪。": "The clifftop has no railing. Keep well back from the edge, and don't inch forward to improve the shot.",
  "这里在格伦峡谷国家休闲区里，要买休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用）。": "This is inside Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, so you need a recreation area pass (America the Beautiful passes are accepted).",
  "片中荒漠戏在鲍威尔湖、格伦峡谷一带拍是确定的；坠湖这场具体在 Alstrom Point，只有《盐湖论坛报》一家写明，剧本里原定的是 Lone Rock。": "The desert scenes were definitely filmed around Lake Powell and Glen Canyon. Only The Salt Lake Tribune places the crash scene at Alstrom Point; the script originally called for Lone Rock.",
  "马特·史密斯": "Matt Smith",
  "鲍威尔湖犹他一侧的 Lone Rock Beach，属格伦峡谷国家休闲区（NPS），在佩吉西北约 15 分钟": "Lone Rock Beach on the Utah side of Lake Powell, in Glen Canyon National Recreation Area (NPS), about 15 minutes northwest of Page",
  "第六季第一集《不可能的宇航员》开篇：博士和同伴们在一片湖边野餐重聚，湖中央立着一块孤零零的大岩石。剧中把这里叫作“寂静湖”（Lake Silencio）。": "The opening of Season 6, Episode 1, “The Impossible Astronaut”: the Doctor and his companions reunite for a lakeside picnic, with a single big rock standing in the middle of the water. The show calls it Lake Silencio.",
  "从 89 号公路转进 Lone Rock Road 开到湖边沙滩，湖中央那块孤岩就是剧中的背景。拍的人站在沙滩上，让孤岩在画面中间偏一侧，人坐在前景的沙滩上；傍晚太阳在背后，孤岩和对岸砂岩被照成橙红色。": "Turn off US-89 onto Lone Rock Road and drive down to the beach; the lone rock in the lake is the backdrop from the show. Stand on the beach with the rock just off center and your subject sitting on the sand in the foreground. In the evening the sun is behind you, and the rock and the sandstone across the water turn orange-red.",
  "沙滩可以开车下去，但沙很软，普通轿车停在硬地上走过去，别开进软沙里。": "You can drive onto the beach, but the sand is very soft. In a regular car, park on firm ground and walk; don't drive into the soft sand.",
  "要买格伦峡谷国家休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用）；旺季周末露营车很多。": "You need a Glen Canyon National Recreation Area pass (America the Beautiful passes are accepted). Peak-season weekends bring a lot of RVs and campers.",
  "湖水位每年变化大，孤岩露出水面的高度和离岸距离会不一样。": "Lake levels change a lot from year to year, so how much of the rock shows above the water, and how far it sits from shore, will vary.",
  "安德鲁·斯坦顿 / 泰勒·基奇": "Andrew Stanton / Taylor Kitsch",
  "鲍威尔湖（格伦峡谷国家休闲区，NPS），具体是哪段湖湾没有公开": "Lake Powell (Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, NPS); exactly which arm of the lake hasn't been made public",
  "南北战争老兵约翰·卡特被送到火星，片中的火星荒漠大多在犹他南部拍。其中一段：卡特和火星公主德嘉·索丽丝从悬停的飞船上跳进河里，再划着小船在红色峡谷之间的水道里往前走。": "Civil War veteran John Carter is transported to Mars, and most of the film's Martian desert was shot in southern Utah. In one sequence Carter and the Martian princess Dejah Thoris leap from a hovering airship into a river, then make their way in a small boat along a waterway between red canyon walls.",
  "鲍威尔湖有很多两侧是红色砂岩壁的窄湖湾，最像片中的水道。从 Antelope Point 坡道划皮划艇进羚羊峡谷的水上部分，或者从 Wahweap 码头坐游船、租船进支湾，拍的人在后面一条船上，用中焦拍前面的船划进峡谷。上午水面平，岩壁倒影最清楚。": "Lake Powell has many narrow side canyons lined with red sandstone walls, the closest match to the film's waterway. Kayak from the Antelope Point launch ramp into the water section of Antelope Canyon, or take a boat tour or rent a boat at Wahweap Marina and head into a side canyon. The photographer rides in a boat behind and uses a medium focal length to shoot the boat ahead as it moves into the canyon. The water is calmest in the morning, when the reflections on the walls are clearest.",
  "湖水凉、午后常起风浪，划皮划艇穿救生衣，跟着有执照的向导去更稳妥。": "The lake is cold, and wind and chop often build in the afternoon. Wear a life jacket when kayaking; going with a licensed guide is the safer choice.",
  "要买格伦峡谷国家休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用）；水位每年变化大，有的支湾低水位时进不去。": "You need a Glen Canyon National Recreation Area pass (America the Beautiful passes are accepted). Lake levels vary a lot from year to year, and some side canyons can't be reached at low water.",
  "《盐湖论坛报》写了这段在鲍威尔湖拍，没写具体在哪段湖湾；照片是鲍威尔湖的 Reflection Canyon，只是同类的景色。": "The Salt Lake Tribune says this sequence was filmed on Lake Powell but doesn't say where on the lake. The photo shows Lake Powell's Reflection Canyon, simply as an example of the same kind of scenery.",
  "凯瑟琳·毕格罗 / 基努·里维斯、帕特里克·斯威兹": "Kathryn Bigelow / Keanu Reeves, Patrick Swayze",
  "鲍威尔湖上空（格伦峡谷国家休闲区，NPS），具体在哪段湖面没有公开": "The skies over Lake Powell (Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, NPS); exactly where over the lake hasn't been made public",
  "FBI 探员约翰尼混进冲浪抢劫团伙以后，跟着团伙老大博迪去跳伞：几个人从飞机上跳下来，在空中手拉手围成一圈，下面是蓝色的湖水和红色砂岩。": "After FBI agent Johnny infiltrates a gang of surfing bank robbers, he follows their leader, Bodhi, on a skydive: the group jumps from a plane and links hands in a circle in midair, with blue water and red sandstone far below.",
  "地面上最接近的视角是佩吉旁边的 Wahweap 观景点：站在高处往下看，湖湾和砂岩岛一起铺开。想看片中那样的俯瞰，可以坐佩吉机场出发的观光飞机，航线和价格以运营方为准。中午光线硬，上午或傍晚湖水颜色更好。": "The closest ground-level view is Wahweap Overlook near Page: from up high you can see the bays and sandstone islands spread out together. For an aerial view like the film's, take a scenic flight from the Page airport; check with operators for routes and prices. Midday light is harsh; the water color is better in the morning or evening.",
  "NPS 管的地方一般不能飞无人机，起飞前查格伦峡谷的最新规定。": "Flying drones is generally prohibited on NPS-managed land. Check Glen Canyon's current rules before you launch.",
  "观景点一带的崖边别靠太近，想体验跳伞找有执照的跳伞场。": "Don't get too close to the cliff edges around the overlook. If you want to try skydiving, go to a licensed skydiving center.",
  "《盐湖论坛报》写了跳伞这场在鲍威尔湖上空拍，没写具体位置。": "The Salt Lake Tribune says the skydiving scene was filmed over Lake Powell but doesn't give the exact location.",
  "理查德·唐纳 / 梅尔·吉布森、朱迪·福斯特": "Richard Donner / Mel Gibson, Jodie Foster",
  "鲍威尔湖西头、犹他一侧 Big Water 附近的湖岸（格伦峡谷国家休闲区，NPS），剧组在这里搭了一座“河边”小镇的布景": "The Lake Powell shoreline near Big Water, at the west end of the lake on the Utah side (Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, NPS), where the crew built a riverside town set",
  "梅尔·吉布森演一个油嘴滑舌的赌徒，一路凑钱去参加扑克大赛。电影前半段那座河边的西部小镇，其实是搭在鲍威尔湖岸边的布景，湖水在片里当成了河。": "Mel Gibson plays a smooth-talking gambler scraping together his stake for a big poker tournament. The riverside Western town in the first half of the film was actually a set built on the shore of Lake Powell, with the lake standing in for a river.",
  "布景早就拆了。Big Water 在佩吉西北约 20 分钟，附近的 Lone Rock Beach 和 Wahweap 一带都是红色台地夹着湖水的景色。在 Wahweap 观景点往下看湖湾，或者到 Lone Rock Beach 的湖边，用中焦把湖面和对岸的砂岩崖拍成“河岸”；傍晚太阳在背后，对岸的崖壁最红。": "The set was dismantled long ago. Big Water is about 20 minutes northwest of Page, and nearby Lone Rock Beach and the Wahweap area have the same mix of red mesas and lake water. Look down on the bays from Wahweap Overlook, or go to the water's edge at Lone Rock Beach, and use a medium focal length to turn the lake and the sandstone cliffs across it into a “riverbank.” In the evening the sun is behind you and the far cliffs are at their reddest.",
  "梅尔·吉布森当年说每天坐船过湖去片场；现在想去对岸要租船或跟游船。": "Mel Gibson said at the time that he crossed the lake by boat to the set every day. To reach the far shore today, rent a boat or take a boat tour.",
  "要买格伦峡谷国家休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用）。": "You need a Glen Canyon National Recreation Area pass (America the Beautiful passes are accepted).",
  "片中还有几场在优胜美地的 Washburn Point 和 Leidig 草甸拍，具体是哪几场没查到。": "The film also shot a few scenes at Washburn Point and Leidig Meadow in Yosemite; we couldn't find which ones.",
  "《德瑟雷特新闻》写了片子前半段的河边小镇在鲍威尔湖犹他一侧拍，《盐湖论坛报》写了在 Big Water 附近；布景的具体位置没有公开。": "The Deseret News says the riverside town in the first half of the film was shot on the Utah side of Lake Powell, and The Salt Lake Tribune says it was near Big Water; the set's exact location hasn't been made public.",
  "西恩·潘 / 埃米尔·赫斯基": "Sean Penn / Emile Hirsch",
  "格伦峡谷国家休闲区的 Lees Ferry（NPS），大峡谷河段漂流的起点，佩吉西南约 1 小时车程": "Lees Ferry in Glen Canyon National Recreation Area (NPS), the starting point for river trips through the Grand Canyon, about an hour's drive southwest of Page",
  "大学毕业生克里斯烧掉钱、给自己改名“超级流浪者”，一路搭车流浪。途中他买了一条皮划艇，想顺着科罗拉多河漂下大峡谷，却被告知要排很多年的队才能拿到许可。": "Fresh out of college, Chris burns his cash, renames himself “Alexander Supertramp,” and hitchhikes his way across the country. Along the way he buys a kayak, hoping to paddle down the Colorado River through the Grand Canyon, only to be told that getting a permit means waiting years.",
  "从佩吉沿 89 号、89A 号公路往西南开，过了 Navajo Bridge 转进 Lees Ferry Road 开到河边。在码头和下游的河滩上，背后是红色的 Vermilion 悬崖，拍的人站在岸上用中焦，让被拍的人拿着桨站在河边、看向下游的峡谷口；下午悬崖顺光最红。": "From Page, follow US-89 and US-89A southwest, cross Navajo Bridge, and turn onto Lees Ferry Road down to the river. At the landing and on the beaches downstream, the red Vermilion Cliffs rise behind you. The photographer stays on shore with a medium focal length while your subject stands at the water's edge holding a paddle, looking downstream toward the mouth of the canyon. In the afternoon the light is on the cliffs and they're at their reddest.",
  "这里的河水是从大坝底下放出来的，常年只有 8–10°C，水流也急，别下水游泳；坐船划船都穿救生衣。": "The river here is released from the bottom of the dam and stays around 46–50°F all year, and the current is swift. Don't swim, and wear a life jacket whenever you're in a boat or kayak.",
  "想真去大峡谷漂流，要提前很久抽签拿许可，或者报商业漂流团；从大坝脚下漂到这里的一日平水漂流不用许可，跟团就行。": "To actually run the Grand Canyon, enter the permit lottery well in advance or book a commercial rafting trip. The one-day smooth-water float from the base of the dam down to here doesn't require a permit; just join a tour.",
  "Lees Ferry 在格伦峡谷国家休闲区里，要买休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用）。": "Lees Ferry is inside Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, so you need a recreation area pass (America the Beautiful passes are accepted).",
  "亚利桑那当地报纸《Arizona Daily Sun》报道剧组在 Lees Ferry 和佩吉拍过，没写是哪场戏；上面写的是故事里和这一带有关的情节。": "The local Arizona Daily Sun reported that the crew filmed at Lees Ferry and in Page but didn't say which scenes. The scene described here is the part of the story connected to this area.",
  "马丁·斯科塞斯 / 莱昂纳多·迪卡普里奥": "Martin Scorsese / Leonardo DiCaprio",
  "阿卡迪亚 Park Loop Road 边的水獭崖": "Otter Cliff, along Acadia's Park Loop Road",
  "故事设在麻省外海的一座精神病院孤岛上，岛边的海崖戏在这里拍：主角在湿滑的粉色花岗岩海崖上攀爬寻找线索，脚下是拍上来的海浪。": "The story is set at a psychiatric hospital on an island off the Massachusetts coast, and the island's sea-cliff scenes were filmed here: the main character climbs slick pink granite cliffs in search of clues, with waves crashing below.",
  "开 Park Loop Road 到水獭崖路边停车处，沿 Ocean Path 走到崖顶，往南回望整段崖壁和海浪。拍的人站在步道上，用中焦把崖壁和海面一起拍；阴天、起雾或大浪的天气最有片中阴郁的感觉；晴天日出时崖壁是粉色的。": "Drive Park Loop Road to the roadside parking at Otter Cliff, follow the Ocean Path to the top of the cliff, and look back south along the cliffs and surf. Stand on the trail and use a medium focal length to frame the cliffs and the sea together. Overcast, foggy, or big-surf days best capture the film's brooding mood; on a clear morning the cliffs turn pink at sunrise.",
  "崖边没有护栏，石头上有青苔和雾气时很滑，别下到崖壁上拍；崖壁上的攀岩者都系着绳子、跟着向导。": "There's no railing at the edge, and the rock gets slippery with moss or fog, so don't climb down onto the cliff face for a photo. The climbers you'll see there are roped in and with guides.",
  "Park Loop Road 这一段只能停在右侧车道，满了就往前开到 Otter Point 停车场。": "Along this stretch of Park Loop Road, parking is in the right-hand lane only. If it's full, continue to the Otter Point parking area.",
  "奥托·普雷明格 / 玛丽莲·梦露、罗伯特·米彻姆": "Otto Preminger / Marilyn Monroe, Robert Mitchum",
  "班夫镇边、费尔蒙班夫温泉酒店脚下的弓河瀑布": "Bow Falls, at the edge of the town of Banff, below the Fairmont Banff Springs",
  "梦露主演的西部片，一家人坐木筏顺着急流逃命，整部片大半时间在河上。片尾几场漂流戏在弓河拍，剧组把一只木筏从弓河瀑布上放了下去。": "In this Western starring Marilyn Monroe, a family flees down whitewater on a log raft, and much of the film takes place on the river. Several of the late rafting scenes were filmed on the Bow River, where the crew sent a raft over Bow Falls.",
  "开到酒店这一侧的 Bow Falls 停车场，走几步到瀑布边的观景处。拍的人站在下游河岸上，用中焦把翻白的瀑布和两岸的松林、山坡一起收进来；想要城堡一样的酒店入画，绕到河对岸的惊喜角（Surprise Corner）。上午瀑布顺光，水花最亮。": "Drive to the Bow Falls parking lot on the hotel side and walk a few steps to the viewing area beside the falls. Stand on the downstream bank and use a medium focal length to take in the churning falls and the pine forest and slopes on both banks. To get the castle-like hotel in the frame, go around to Surprise Corner on the other side of the river. In the morning the sun is on the falls and the spray is brightest.",
  "瀑布下的水流很急、水温很低，别下到河边的湿石头上。": "The current below the falls is fast and the water is very cold, so stay off the wet rocks at the river's edge.",
  "从镇中心沿弓河边的步道走到瀑布约 20 分钟，夏天停车场常满。": "From downtown it's about a 20-minute walk to the falls on the trail along the Bow River, and the lot often fills in summer.",
  "片子在班夫、贾斯珀国家公园拍是确定的（AFI 记了片方资料）；弓河瀑布这场只有艾伯塔省历史遗产部门的博客一家写明。梦露拍片时在贾斯珀的玛琳河滑倒受伤，那一段没写进来。": "The film definitely shot in Banff and Jasper national parks; the AFI Catalog records it from studio materials. Only a blog from Alberta's provincial historic resources office names Bow Falls for this scene. Monroe slipped and was injured in Jasper's Maligne River during the shoot, but that location isn't included here.",
  "柳英恩 / 金宣虎、高允真": "Yoo Young-eun / Kim Seon-ho, Go Youn-jung",
  "班夫国家公园的路易斯湖湖边，对面是维多利亚冰川，背后是费尔蒙城堡酒店": "The shore of Lake Louise in Banff National Park, facing Victoria Glacier, with the Fairmont Chateau Lake Louise behind",
  "Netflix 韩剧：会八种语言的翻译周浩镇，给因丧尸片爆红的女明星车茂熙当随行翻译，跟着她去日本、加拿大、意大利拍恋爱综艺。到了加拿大落基山，两人在湖边并肩散步、慢慢说出心里话；剧里一起看极光的戏也在湖边。": "A Korean Netflix drama: Joo Ho-jin, an interpreter who speaks eight languages, becomes the personal interpreter for Cha Mu-hee, an actress who shot to fame with a zombie movie, and follows her to Japan, Canada, and Italy as she films a dating reality show. In the Canadian Rockies, the two walk side by side along the lake and slowly open up to each other; the scene where they watch the northern lights together is also set by the lake.",
  "从停车场走到城堡酒店前的湖岸，再沿湖岸的平路往冰川方向走一段，人就少了。拍的人在湖岸上往冰川方向拍，两个人沿湖边并肩走、背对镜头。剧组是秋天拍的，9 月下旬到 10 月初湖水还绿、山顶已经有雪。想碰极光要看太阳活动预报，选晴朗、没月亮的晚上，离酒店的灯光远一点。": "From the parking lot, walk to the lakeshore in front of the Chateau, then follow the flat shoreline path a ways toward the glacier, where the crowds thin out. The photographer stands on the shore shooting toward the glacier as two people walk side by side along the water, backs to the camera. The crew filmed in fall; from late September to early October the lake is still green and there's already snow on the peaks. To catch the northern lights, watch the aurora forecast, pick a clear, moonless night, and get away from the hotel lights.",
  "夏秋湖边停车场很早就满，停车要付费，也可以坐 Parks Canada 的班车。": "In summer and fall the lakeshore lot fills very early, and parking is paid. You can also take the Parks Canada shuttle.",
  "晚上湖边很冷，秋天也常在零度以下；看极光带厚衣服和头灯，走回停车场注意野生动物。": "Nights by the lake are cold, often below freezing even in fall. For aurora watching, bring warm layers and a headlamp, and watch for wildlife on the walk back to the parking lot.",
  "班夫一带纬度不算高，强极光时才看得清，能不能碰上全看运气。": "Banff isn't especially far north, so the aurora is clearly visible only during strong displays. Seeing it is entirely a matter of luck.",
  "《韩国时报》写了一起看极光的戏在路易斯湖拍；也有韩国网站说看极光那场在国家公园外的坎莫尔（Canmore），湖边散步那段才在路易斯湖。": "The Korea Times says the aurora scene was filmed at Lake Louise. A Korean website says the aurora scene was shot in Canmore, outside the national park, and that only the lakeside walk was filmed at Lake Louise.",
  "班夫镇中央公园（Central Park）旁、弓河上的红色步行桥": "The red pedestrian bridge over the Bow River beside Central Park in the town of Banff",
  "第 5 集，两人在班夫镇逛街、喝咖啡，走到弓河上的步行桥上玩起“翻译游戏”。这座桥现在常有韩剧粉丝排队拍照。": "In Episode 5 the two wander around the town of Banff, stop for coffee, and end up playing a “translation game” on the footbridge over the Bow River. Fans of the show now often line up on the bridge for photos.",
  "从 Banff Avenue 往南走到弓河边，往西拐进中央公园，步行桥就在公园旁边。拍的人站在河岸上，用中焦把整座桥和后面的 Cascade 山一起拍；想拍桥上的人，就站在桥头往桥中间拍。早上人少，傍晚桥身被斜光照亮。": "Walk south on Banff Avenue to the Bow River and turn west into Central Park; the footbridge is right beside the park. From the riverbank, use a medium focal length to frame the whole bridge with Cascade Mountain behind it. For people on the bridge, stand at one end and shoot toward the middle. Mornings are quieter; in the evening low-angled light falls across the bridge.",
  "桥上走人也走自行车，拍照时靠边站，别挡路。": "The bridge carries both pedestrians and bikes, so step to the side for photos and don't block the way.",
  "镇中心停车紧张，住在镇上走过去最方便，也可以坐 Roam 公交。": "Parking downtown is tight. If you're staying in town, walking over is easiest, or take Roam Transit.",
  "《Daily Hive》写了第 5 集在班夫中央公园的步行桥拍；桥上玩翻译游戏的情节来自韩国网站的整理。": "Daily Hive says Episode 5 was filmed on the footbridge by Banff's Central Park; the translation-game storyline comes from a roundup on a Korean website.",
  "迈克尔·贝": "Michael Bay",
  "白沙国家公园和相邻的白沙导弹靶场": "White Sands National Park and the adjacent White Sands Missile Range",
  "片中“中东沙漠”里美军小队被机器人追击的段落，在白沙一带纯白的石膏沙丘里拍，画面是一望无际的白色沙丘和蓝天。": "The sequence in which a squad of U.S. soldiers is hunted by a robot in a “Middle East desert” was filmed in the pure white gypsum dunes around White Sands: nothing but white dunes and blue sky as far as the eye can see.",
  "开沙丘大道到最里面 Heart of the Sands 一带的停车处，往沙丘里走几分钟，找没有脚印的沙脊。拍的人蹲低用广角，让人从沙丘顶上往下冲向镜头；下午四五点斜光下沙纹最清楚，正午白沙反光太强、画面发灰。": "Drive Dunes Drive to the parking areas at the far end, around Heart of the Sands, and walk a few minutes into the dunes to find a ridge without footprints. Crouch low with a wide-angle lens as your subject charges down from the top of a dune toward the camera. Around 4–5 p.m. the low light shows the ripples best; at midday the glare off the white sand washes the picture out.",
  "导弹试验时沙丘大道会封闭最多 3 小时，出发前一天查 NPS 的 Park Closures 页面。": "Dunes Drive can close for up to 3 hours during missile tests. Check the NPS Park Closures page the day before you go.",
  "夏天沙面反光很晒，戴墨镜、带足水；进沙丘记好回停车处的方向，白沙里很容易迷路。": "The glare off the sand is intense in summer, so wear sunglasses and carry plenty of water. Note the way back to your parking area before heading into the dunes; it's easy to get lost in the white sand.",
  "NPS 白沙的拍摄历史页面把《变形金刚》两部都列为在白沙拍的片子，但没写哪些镜头在国家公园里；第二部的沙漠大战明确是在旁边的导弹靶场拍的（游客进不去），所以没收第二部。": "White Sands' NPS filming-history page lists both of the first two Transformers films as shot at White Sands, but doesn't say which scenes were inside the national park. The sequel's big desert battle was clearly filmed on the neighboring missile range, which is closed to the public, so the sequel isn't included.",
  "尼古拉斯·罗格 / 大卫·鲍伊": "Nicolas Roeg / David Bowie",
  "白沙国家公园的石膏沙丘（当年还叫白沙国家纪念地，具体在哪片沙丘没有公开）": "The gypsum dunes of White Sands National Park (then still White Sands National Monument; exactly which dunes hasn't been made public)",
  "大卫·鲍伊演一个从缺水星球来到地球的外星人。片中闪回他家乡星球的段落，一家人走在一望无际、白得发亮的荒漠里，那片荒漠就是用白沙拍的。": "David Bowie plays an alien who comes to Earth from a planet running out of water. In flashbacks to his home planet, his family walks across an endless, dazzling white desert, and that desert is White Sands.",
  "开沙丘大道到最里面 Heart of the Sands 一带，往没有植物的大沙丘里走几分钟。拍的人站在沙脊上，让被拍的人穿深色衣服、走在纯白的沙谷里，人放小；日落前后沙丘发蓝发粉，最像片里那种不属于地球的颜色。": "Drive Dunes Drive to the far end, around Heart of the Sands, and walk a few minutes into the big dunes where nothing grows. The photographer stands on a dune ridge while your subject, dressed in dark clothes, walks through a pure white trough below, small in the frame. Around sunset the dunes turn blue and pink, closest to the film's not-of-this-Earth colors.",
  "夏天沙面反光很晒，带足水；进沙丘记好回停车处的方向，白沙里很容易迷路。": "The glare off the sand is intense in summer, so carry plenty of water. Note the way back to your parking area before heading into the dunes; it's easy to get lost in the white sand.",
  "NPS 白沙的拍摄历史页面列了这部片；用白沙拍外星人家乡的说法来自影评，具体是哪几个镜头没有公开。": "White Sands' NPS filming-history page lists this film. The idea that White Sands stood in for the alien's home planet comes from film reviews, and exactly which shots were filmed here hasn't been made public.",
  "让-马克·瓦雷 / 瑞茜·威瑟斯彭": "Jean-Marc Vallée / Reese Witherspoon",
  "火山口湖环湖公路（Rim Drive）北侧、北入口路交汇处附近，往北能看到浮石沙漠（Pumice Desert）": "The north side of Crater Lake's Rim Drive, near the junction with the North Entrance Road, looking north over the Pumice Desert",
  "雪儿背着巨大的登山包独自走太平洋山脊步道，走到火山口湖边停下来，望着远处的浮石荒原，坐在树下换衣服、整理背包，然后继续往坡下走。": "Cheryl is hiking the Pacific Crest Trail alone under an enormous pack. At Crater Lake she stops and gazes out at the pumice flats in the distance, changes clothes and repacks under a tree, then keeps going down the slope.",
  "从北入口路进园，到和环湖公路交汇的 North Junction 一带，找路边的观景停车处。被拍的人背着大包站在路边树旁、看向北边空旷的浮石沙漠，拍的人在侧后方用中焦拍背影；想要湖景，就近到 Merriam Point，或往南几分钟到守望者峰观景台。下午光线从西边来，比较柔。": "Enter on the North Entrance Road and look for a roadside viewpoint pullout around North Junction, where it meets Rim Drive. Your subject stands by a tree at the roadside wearing a big pack, looking north over the open Pumice Desert, while you shoot from behind and to one side with a medium focal length. For a lake view, stop at nearby Merriam Point, or drive a few minutes south to Watchman Overlook. Afternoon light comes from the west and is fairly soft.",
  "北入口路和环湖公路西段冬天封闭，通常 7 月前后才开，以 NPS 路况为准。": "The North Entrance Road and the west side of Rim Drive close for winter and usually open around July; check NPS road status.",
  "环湖公路弯多、路肩窄，只在观景停车处停车拍。": "Rim Drive is winding with narrow shoulders, so stop only at viewpoint pullouts.",
  "太平洋山脊步道在这一段穿过公园，想走一小段可以从北入口路边的步道口进去。": "The Pacific Crest Trail crosses the park in this area. For a short walk on it, start from the trailhead along the North Entrance Road.",
  "只有克拉马斯福尔斯当地报纸《Herald and News》一家现场报道写明，在环湖公路北侧拍、望向浮石沙漠；具体停车处是推断的。": "Only one on-the-scene report, from the Klamath Falls newspaper Herald and News, says filming took place on the north side of Rim Drive looking toward the Pumice Desert. The specific pullout is our inference."
};
